38","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#status","content":"上述所有阶段都已在 `crates/` 中实现（`cargo test --workspace`；`cargo run -p kardia -- examples/kardia.yml` 会从一个受监视的配置文件启动应用）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1170":{"id":"/docs/development-status-39","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#status","content":"每个 TypeScript spec 的每个用例都已移植、确认已被覆盖，或判定为不适用。不适用的用例测试的是没有 Rust 对应物的 JavaScript 或 Node 机制：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1171":{"id":"/docs/development-status-40","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#status","content":"装饰器、原型和基于 Proxy 的可调用服务、`this` 绑定；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1172":{"id":"/docs/development-status-41","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#status","content":"waterfall 和已弃用的 `dispatch` API；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1173":{"id":"/docs/development-status-42","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#status","content":"Node 模块解析与加载器内部（`resolve`、`import`、`create`、`package-manager`、`loader-utils`）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1174":{"id":"/docs/development-status-43","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#status","content":"文件 URL 与 Windows 盘符；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1175":{"id":"/docs/development-status-44","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#status","content":"JavaScript 栈帧；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1176":{"id":"/docs/development-status-45","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#status","content":"对同一个异步迭代器的并发读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1177":{"id":"/docs/development-status-46","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#status","content":"kardia 已在 crates.io 上以 `kardia` 和九个 `kardia-*` crate 的形式发布；各版本见 Releases。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1178":{"id":"/docs/development-status-47","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#status","content":"CI（`.github/workflows/ci.yml`）在改动 Rust 代码的推送和拉取请求上，在固定的工具链（Rust 1.99.1）上运行 `cargo fmt --check`、将警告视为错误的 clippy、`cargo xtask arch` 以及测试套件，因为 `kardia-macros` 的编译错误快照会随编译器而变化。推送 `v*` 标签会运行 `release.yml`：复用 CI 对该标签所指提交的运行结果，然后对 crates.io 上尚不存在的每个 crate 版本执行 `cargo publish --workspace`，并等待 crates.io 对新 crate 的数量限制过去，最后创建 GitHub Release。该工作流也可以手动启动，以继续一次中途停止的发布。参与开发逐步描述了这些工作流。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1179":{"id":"/docs/development-status-48","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"以下是实现偏离本计划或 TypeScript 代码之处。其中三项较长，在表格下方各有一个小节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1180":{"id":"/docs/development-status-49","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"主题","locale":"zh-CN"},"1181":{"id":"/docs/development-status-50","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"实现","locale":"zh-CN"},"1182":{"id":"/docs/development-status-51","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"已退役的提供者","locale":"zh-CN"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/development-status-52","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"由属性测试发现：退役一个纤程会立即解除其存活的提供，因此后继者可以在同一领域中提供服务，而旧的消费者仍在排空（它们通过自己的已提交视图读取）。TS 代码会一直保留该槽位直到排空结束，并使后继者失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/development-status-53","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"过期的加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/development-status-54","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"已退役纤程仍在进行中的加载可以注册逆操作（因此它获取的任何东西都不会泄漏），但不能注册提供。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1186":{"id":"/docs/development-status-55","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"排空期间移除提供","locale":"zh-CN"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/development-status-56","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"推迟到提供者排空结束时，这样后代在自身清理期间仍能访问继承的服务，而无需依赖微任务的顺序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1188":{"id":"/docs/development-status-57","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"可重新指向的上下文","locale":"zh-CN"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/development-status-58","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"作用域节点携带其纤程；一次访问的纤程链从派生链上读出，因此移动一个条目也会移动它下面的纤程（TS 原型的行为）。条目表是可变的 `Overlay` 节点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/development-status-59","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"带检查的类型化访问","locale":"zh-CN"},"1191":{"id":"/docs/development-status-60","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"`Injected<D>::get::<S, _>()`（`_` 是 `S` 在 `D` 中被推断出的位置）；未声明的 `S` 无法通过编译。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1192":{"id":"/docs/development-status-61","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"表达式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/development-status-62","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"一个无副作用的 JavaScript 子集（`kardia_loader::expr`），作用于服务的 JSON 视图；不支持函数调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1194":{"id":"/docs/development-status-63","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/development-status-64","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[