lopment-status-73","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"加载器钩子","locale":"zh-CN"},"1205":{"id":"/docs/development-status-74","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"`loader/patch-context` 即 `Loader::on_patch_context(ctx, hook)`；`EntryHandle::init`；一个没有 Rust 对应物的 hmr 用例。见加载器钩子。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1206":{"id":"/docs/development-status-75","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"模型测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"1207":{"id":"/docs/development-status-76","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"属性测试以带随机延迟的真实 tokio 调度驱动，而不是确定性调度器。它们在每次运行期间检查顺序性，并在静止时检查保持性、恢复精确性和合流性（活跃纤程恰好是支撑集）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/development-status-77","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"动态模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/development-status-78","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"`ModuleSource` / `ModuleGraph` / `Hmr`，三个共享同一套 JSON 访客（guest）ABI 的文件后端（WASM、dylib、进程），`kardia-guest` SDK 以及监视模式。见动态模块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/development-status-79","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#errors","content":"配置文件的解析错误和校验错误携带 `file:line:col`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/development-status-80","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#errors","content":"加载器为某个条目记录的错误（选项与配置校验、`ModuleNotFound`、表达式失败）通过 `TreeBackend::locate` / `locate_expr` 定位：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/development-status-81","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#errors","content":"每个问题得到 `(at path, file:line:col)`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1213":{"id":"/docs/development-status-82","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#errors","content":"表达式失败得到一个 `at <path> (file:line:col)` 帧；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/development-status-83","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#errors","content":"条目以及每个有位置的祖先各得到一个 `at <id> (file:line:col)` 帧，","locale":"zh-CN"},"1215":{"id":"/docs/development-status-84","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#errors","content":"它们以文本形式给出，而不是改写 JS 栈。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/development-status-85","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#errors","content":"include（配置文件引入）在值的所有者写下它们的地方定位这些值（所有者的文件，或其父级文件中的一个补丁），别名定位到其锚点，表达式中的字符穿过 YAML 转义定位。运行时更改的值不会被定位。`Entry::evaluate` 未公开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/development-status-86","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#loader-hooks","content":"`loader/patch-context` waterfall 即 `Loader::on_patch_context(ctx, hook)`：钩子接收条目，以及以 future 形式表示的链的其余部分，这个 future 只有在被 await 时才会构建其余部分；钩子在加载器自身的隔离步骤中按注册顺序运行，并随 `ctx` 的纤程一起移除。与 TS 不同，新的隔离表与链末尾的重新设定父级一起安装，而不是在钩子运行之前安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/development-status-87","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#loader-hooks","content":"`EntryHandle::init` 启动一个条目，或者加入它尚未完成的启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/development-status-88","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#loader-hooks","content":"hmr 的 `index` 用例“waits for a second re-enable init”在 Rust 中没有可等待的 hmr 决定（被挂起的卸载完成时，事务已经做出决定）；它的移植版本检查重新启用之后只留下一个存活实例，且 hmr 不会额外执行 apply。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/development-status-89","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"`ModuleSource` / `ModuleGraph` / `Hmr`，加上三个共享同一套 JSON 访客 ABI（记录在 `kardia-hmr` crate 文档中）的文件后端，以及一个为每个纤程实例化访客的桥接插件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/development-status-90","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/development-status-91","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"工作方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/development-status-92","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"`WasmSource`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/development-status-93","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"在 wasmtime 上运行核心 WASM 模块（每个纤程一个 store），而不是 WIT 组件，因此访客不需要组件工具链（测试用 WAT 编写）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1225":{"id":"/docs/development-status-94","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"`DylibSource`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/development-status-95","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"使用 C ABI，而不是传递 Rust 类型：cdylib 带有自己的一份 `kardia-core` 和 tokio，有独立的静态变量，也没有运行时上下文。每个版本都从一份唯一的副本加载，且永不卸载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1227":{"id":"/docs/development-status-96","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"`ProcessSource`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1228":{"id":"/docs/development-status-97","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"运行可执行文件，每个纤程一个子进程，通过 stdin 和 stdout 上的 JSON 行使用同一套 ABI（重新启动进程 = 重载；崩溃的访客只会使它自己的调用失败，破坏协议的访客会被杀死）。没有单独的代理服务：每个纤程的 `GuestService` 就是 RPC 端点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1229":{"id":"/docs/development-status-98","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"与其他后端一样，进程后端的调用是同步的，而不是论文 §6.2 中的异步 RPC 约定：它们会阻塞调用者直到访客应答，因此挂起的访客也会阻塞调用者。`kardia` 二进制按文件扩展名选择后端，并且不加载进程访客。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/development-status-99","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"访客服务是带 JSON 调用的 JSON 视图（`GuestService`）。`kardia-guest` 是 Rust 访客 SDK：一个 `Guest` trait 和 `export!`，后者在 wasm32 上生成 WASM 导出，在其他平台上生成 C 符号，因此同一份源码可以为两种后端构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/development-status-100","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"监视模式（`HmrConfig { base, watch: { enabled, files, debounce } }`）遵循 TS 代码：它通过 `fs` 监视 `base`，把每个防抖窗口内的变化作为一批重载，每次只处理一批。导入失败的文件会随下一批重试，而宿主模块的变化只会被报告。`base` 相对于 hmr 条目所在配置文件的目录解析（与 TS 代码使用 `ctx.baseUrl` 的方式相同），没有配置文件时则相对于工作目录解析。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/development-status-101","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"`kardia` 二进制注册了 `hmr`，并把任何不是内置插件的条目名称解析为相对于配置文件的访客模块：`examples/kardia.yml` 会热重载 `plugins/hello.wat`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/development-status-102","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#dynamic-modules","content":"关于如何使用访客，见访客插件和热重载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/development-status-103","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"`js/` 中是 npm 包 `@kardiajs/core`、`@kardiajs/timer`、`@kardiajs/bridge`、`@kardiajs/tauri` 和 `@kardiajs/vue`，`crates/kardia-bridge` 是桥的 Rust 宿主端（TypeScript 与 Tauri）。它们与 crate 分开版本化和发布（参与开发）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1235":{"id":"/docs/development-status-104","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"`@kardiajs/core` 移植的是 Kardia 的核心（状态机、带检查的访问、效应引擎与日志器），而不是 TypeScript Cordis 的代码。它在运行时和开发时都不依赖 Cordis：本仓库从未依赖过（`cordis/` 是被 gitignore 的本地参考副本），这些包也没有任何运行时依赖。它的测试套件移植了 Cordis 中相关的 spec。不同之处：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/development-status-105","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"主题","locale":"zh-CN"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/development-status-106","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"`@kardiajs/core`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/development-status-107","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"服务访问","locale":"zh-CN"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/development-status-108","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"使用 `ctx.get(key)` / `ctx.live(key)`，而不是通过 `Proxy` 上下文的属性访问。用 `definePlugin` 定义的插件得到一个按其 `inject` 定型的上下文，因此访问未声明的服务是类型错误（对应 Kardia 的 `Injected<D>`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/development-status-109","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"调用者归属","locale":"zh-CN"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/development-status-110","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"`ctx.get` 返回的 `Service` 是一个视图，其 `caller` 是发起访问的上下文（对应 Kardia 的 `Svc::caller`）。视图是 `Proxy` 对象，服务的 `#private` 字段无法穿过它；请使用 `private`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/development-status-111","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"`apply`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/development-status-112","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"可以返回 promise，或返回一个在插件停止时运行的函数（与 Cordis 相同；Kardia 的 `apply` 只返回结果）。类按纤程实例化；没有 `Service.init`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/development-status-113","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"效应","locale":"zh-CN"},"1245":{"id":"/docs/development-status-114","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"`ctx.effect(scope => ...)`，配合 `scope.defer`、`scope.adopt` 和 `scope.checkpoint`，或返回一个撤销函数（相当于 Kardia 的 `effect_sync` / `effect` 合一）。没有生成器或异步迭代器形式的效应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/development-status-115","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"内部事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/development-status-116","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"使用 `internal/plugin-inserted` 和 `internal/plugin-removed`（对应 Kardia 的 `PluginInserted` / `PluginRemoved`），而不是 Cordis 的单个 `internal/plugin`；`internal/status` 同时传递旧状态和新状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/development-status-117","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1249":{"id":"/docs/development-status-118","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"与 Kardia 相同：`emit` 记录失败的监听器并继续运行其余监听器；没有 `waterfall`；更新钩子是 `ctx.onUpdate`。没有装饰器，也不绑定监听器的 `this`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/development-status-119","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"`update` / `restart`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1251":{"id":"/docs/development-status-120","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"配置无效或纤程已退役时立即抛出（对应 Kardia 的 `Result`）；它们返回的 promise 随纤程一起结算，并被标记为已处理，因此丢弃它不会引发未处理的拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/development-status-121","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"`ctx.inject(deps, apply)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1253":{"id":"/docs/development-status-122","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"每次调用都创建一个独立的插件，因此 `registry.replace` 无法指向它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/development-status-123","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/development-status-124","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"纤程在其插件的最后一个纤程退役后仍保留插件名称，因此移除时的事件仍带有该名称。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/development-status-125","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"加载器、include、HMR","locale":"zh-CN"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/development-status-126","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"未移植：它们读取文件，而客户端运行在 webview 中。Vite 的 HMR 可以驱动 `registry.replace`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/development-status-127","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#typescript","content":"与访客 ABI（动态模块）不同，桥的调用是异步的：这正是论文 §6.2 中的异步约定。它的端到端测试从 TypeScript 客户端驱动真实的 Rust 宿主。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/development-testing","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"page","content":"测试策略","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing","locale":"zh-CN"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-0","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"kar