,"1562":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"**`intercept`** 是从服务名到元数据的映射。修改它会原地作用于运行中的插件，无需重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1563":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"**`isolate`** 是从服务名到 `true`（该条目私有的作用域）或标签（所有带该标签的条目共享的作用域）的映射。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1564":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#entry-fields","content":"其他任何键都会被容忍并保留：文件始终是事实来源，因此未知键在写回后依然存在。加载器深入讲解分组、隔离（isolation）与拦截。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1565":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#expressions","content":"带有 `!!js` 标签的值是一个表达式，例如 `disabled: !!js \"!settings.enabled\"`。在 JSON 中写作 `{ \"__jsExpr\": \"!settings.enabled\" }`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1566":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#expressions","content":"**语法**：JavaScript 的一个无副作用子集：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1567":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#expressions","content":"字面量（数字、字符串、`true`、`false`、`null`、`undefined`），数组和对象字面量；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1568":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#expressions","content":"成员访问：`a.b`、`a[0]`、`a?.b`，字符串和数组的 `.length`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1569":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#expressions","content":"一元 `!`、`-`、`+`；算术 `+ - * / %`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1570":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","