nfiguration-172","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#hmr","content":"`watch.files`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1699":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-173","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#hmr","content":"模式列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"1700":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-174","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#hmr","content":"`[\".\", \"!**/.*\", \"!**/target\"]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1701":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-175","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#hmr","content":"要监视的文件，相对于 `base`；`!` 表示排除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1702":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-176","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#hmr","content":"`watch.debounce`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1703":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-177","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#hmr","content":"毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"1704":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-178","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#hmr","content":"`100`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1705":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-179","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#hmr","content":"同一时间窗口内的变化会一起重新加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1706":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-180","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#hmr","content":"重新加载的工作方式见热重载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1707":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-181","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#timer-and-fs","content":"二者都不接受配置。它们提供 `timer` 和 `fs` 服务；插件如何使用它们见服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1708":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"page","content":"可撤销效应与纤程","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","使用指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects","locale":"zh-CN"},"1709":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects","content":"登记逆操作，编写带初始化的效应，使用效应作用域与迭代边界，控制插件的纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1710":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"登记逆操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"1711":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#effects","content":"带初始化的效应","locale":"zh-CN"},"1712":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`EffectScope`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1713":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"迭代边界与中断","locale":"zh-CN"},"1714":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"`EffectHandle`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1715":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"释放顺序与错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"1716":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"纤程","locale":"zh-CN"},"1717":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#states","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"1718":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#fiber-handle","content":"`Fiber` 句柄","locale":"zh-CN"},"1719":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"更新、重启与释放","locale":"zh-CN"},"1720":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#replace","content":"替换实现","locale":"zh-CN"},"1721":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects","content":"插件建立的一切（监听器、计时器、服务、子插件）都是**效应**（effect）：一次初始化，配上它的**逆操作**，即撤销它的撤销函数（disposer）。效应登记在插件的**纤程**（fiber）上；纤程卸载时，所有逆操作都会运行。正因如此，你可以在应用运行时重新配置、替换或停止任何插件，而不会泄漏它获取的资源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1722":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects","content":"本页介绍如何登记效应、效应如何被释放，以及纤程句柄能做什么。理论见可撤销效应；设计决策（非拥有的句柄、用惯性加载代替丢弃 future）见 API 设计；底层的状态机见核心数据结构。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1723":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"最简单的效应，是为刚做的事登记一个普通逆操作：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1724":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1725":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"在当前纤程上登记","locale":"zh-CN"},"1726":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`ctx.on_dispose(f)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1727":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"一个同步逆操作 `f: FnOnce()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1728":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`ctx.defer(label, disposer)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1729":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"任意 `Disposer`，带一个在内省中显示的标签","locale":"zh-CN"},"1730":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"两者都返回 `Result<EffectHandle>`。在已退役的纤程上，它们以 `KardiaError::InactiveEffect`（`cannot create effect on inactive context`）失败；唯一的例外是：已退役但自身加载仍在进行的纤程仍可收集逆操作，随后的卸载会撤销它们，从而保证这次加载获取的东西不会泄漏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1731":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`Disposer` 是效应的逆操作。它在运行时被消耗，因此至多运行一次：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1732":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"构造函数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1733":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"逆操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"1734":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`Disposer::new(f)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1735":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"同步的 `FnOnce()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1736":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`Disposer::fallible(f)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1737":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"同步的 `FnOnce() -> Result<()>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1738":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`Disposer::future(f)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1739":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"释放开始时同步运行 `f`，`f` 返回一个完成剩余工作的 future","locale":"zh-CN"},"1740":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`Disposer::try_future(f)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1741":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"同上，future 可失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"1742":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"撤销函数中的 panic，无论同步还是异步，都会被捕获并作为错误报告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1743":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#effects","content":"当初始化本身可能失败，或要登记多个逆操作时，把它写成效应体。效应体拿到一个 `EffectScope`，用来收集逆操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1744":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#effects","content":"**同步：** `ctx.effect_sync(label, |scope| { … })` 立即运行效应体。若效应体失败（或 panic），它已收集的一切都会被释放，并返回该错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1745":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#effects","content":"**异步：** `ctx.effect(label, |scope| async move { … })` 以任务形式运行效应体。它绝不会中途被丢弃：释放会等待它运行到结尾或到达迭代边界。失败时会释放效应体已收集的内容、记录日志，并通过 `EffectHandle::ready()` 报告。返回 `Interrupted`（见下文）不算失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1746":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1747":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1748":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`scope.defer(disposer)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1749":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"收集一个逆操作，不设迭代边界","locale":"zh-CN"},"1750":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`scope.defer_fn(f)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1751":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"推迟一个同步逆操作的简写","locale":"zh-CN"},"1752":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`scope.adopt(handle)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1753":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"把一个嵌套效应移到当前效应之下：它不再由纤程直接释放，而是随当前效应一起释放（所有权转移）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1754":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`scope.checkpoint()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1755":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"迭代边界：效应被释放后返回 `Err(Interrupted)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1756":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`scope.yield_(disposer)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1757":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"收集一个逆操作并标记一个迭代边界","locale":"zh-CN"},"1758":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`checkpoint` 和 `yield_` 是同步的，返回 `Result<(), Interrupted>`，用 `?` 传播即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1759":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"在效应体内用 `ctx.effect(..)` 或 `ctx.effect_sync(..)` 创建的嵌套效应，与其他效应一样登记在纤程上。`scope.adopt(handle)` 接管它，使它在（且仅在）外层效应撤销时撤销。任何 `Fiber` 都可转换为创建它的那个 `EffectHandle`，因此作用域也可以接管子插件：`scope.adopt(&ctx.plugin::<Child>(())?)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1760":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"已被取代的加载（插件被重新配置、依赖发生变化或被释放）不会通过丢弃其 future 来取消：在\"获取资源\"和\"登记其逆操作\"之间被丢弃的 future，恰恰会泄漏效应承诺回收的东西。因此宿主（host）是**惯性**（inertia）的：过期的加载会运行到结尾，然后被卸载。若想更早停止，加载需要在显式的**迭代边界**处检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1761":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"边界","locale":"zh-CN"},"1762":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"以 `Interrupted` 失败的时机","locale":"zh-CN"},"1763":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"`ctx.checkpoint()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1764":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"在插件的 `apply` 中，当其加载已被取代或纤程已退役（论文的 L-Divert）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1765":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"`scope.checkpoint()` / `scope.yield_(d)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1766":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"在效应体中，当该效应已被释放","locale":"zh-CN"},"1767":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"用 `?` 传播 `Interrupted` 不算失败：纤程（或效应）不会变成 `Failed`，已登记的内容照常释放。`Error::is_interrupted()` 可以把它和真正的错误区分开。加载器对带 `inject` 的条目使用这种模式：外层纤程解析插件，执行 `ctx.checkpoint()?`，然后启动内层纤程。其中的理由见 API 设计。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1768":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"每次登记效应都返回一个 `EffectHandle`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1769":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1770":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"1771":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"`handle.label()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1772":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"效应的标签","locale":"zh-CN"},"1773":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"`handle.is_active()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1774":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"是否尚未被释放","locale":"zh-CN"},"1775":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"`handle.dispose()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1776":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"撤销该效应（至多一次），返回一个 `Disposal`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1777":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"`handle.ready()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1778":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"一个 future，在初始化完成时完成（同步效应立即完成）；初始化失败时带回该失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"1779":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"`handle.meta()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1780":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"用于内省的 `EffectMeta { label, children }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1781":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"`EffectHandle` 是**非拥有**的：丢弃它不会释放效应。效应的生命期由它登记所在的纤程决定，这正是论文区分 Cordis 与 RAII 之处。词法作用域是互补的，适用于某个效应内部的局部资源：在撤销函数内部，普通的 `Drop` 类型完全可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1782":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"`Disposal` 表示一次释放的完成。它无需被轮询就会推进：`dispose()` 返回时同步部分已经运行完毕，异步的剩余部分作为单独的任务运行，所以丢弃 `Disposal` 不会取消它。等待它即可观察结果；`disposal.is_ready()` 表示是否一切都已同步完成。释放一个初始化仍在运行的异步效应时，会先等待初始化结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1783":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"**在一个效应内部**（一个 `effect_sync` 效应体、一个 `effect` 效应体，或一个作用域接管的逆操作），逆操作**按从新到旧的顺序依次**运行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1784":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"同步逆操作立即运行；从第一个异步逆操作起，其余部分作为单独的任务运行；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1785":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"即使前面的逆操作失败，每个逆操作仍会运行，结果是第一个错误；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1786":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"推迟到一个正在被释放的效应上的逆操作会立即运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1787":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"**纤程卸载时**，运行时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1788":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"等待，直到不再有消费者依赖该纤程提供的服务（每个消费者先完成自己的拆除）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1789":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"按从新到旧取出纤程的效应；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1790":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"**并发地**释放它们，记录每个失败和 panic；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1791":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"然后释放该纤程所提交的服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1792":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"因此同一纤程的兄弟效应并发清理，这是 Cordis 的测试所要求的（`service-dispose.spec.ts`）。若拆除步骤必须有序，请把它们放进**同一个**效应：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1793":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"卸载父插件会级联到子插件：每个子插件都是其父插件的一个效应，所以父插件卸载时会释放它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1794":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"**纤程**是插件的一次实例化。实例化插件时，会在当前纤程上登记一个效应，其逆操作让新纤程退役：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1795":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1796":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"实例化","locale":"zh-CN"},"1797":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"`ctx.plugin::<P>(config)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1798":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"带类型化配置的类型化插件（`P::Config: Serialize`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1799":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"`ctx.plugin_value::<P>(value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1800":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"以原始 JSON 配置实例化类型化插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1801":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"`ctx.plugin_def(&def, value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1802":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"一个 `PluginDef`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1803":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"`ctx.inject(deps, \\|ctx\\| async move { … })`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1804":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"带给定依赖的匿名闭包插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1805":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"它们都返回 `Result<Fiber>`。让纤程退役后再次启用插件，会创建一个**新**纤程，而不是旧的那个。`ctx.fiber()` 返回上下文所属的纤程；`Context::new()` 创建一个根，其纤程始终处于活动状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1806":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#states","content":"`FiberState`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1807":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#states","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"1808":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#states","content":"`Pending`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1809":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#states","content":"等待依赖","locale":"zh-CN"},"1810":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-101","page_id":"/doc