pe":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"若纤程已加载，先校验新配置；被拒绝的配置会返回错误，运行中的实例不受影响。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1853":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"除非设置了 `no_save`，发出 `ConfigCommitted { fiber, config }`（加载器据此把它回写到配置文件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1854":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"保存配置，并清除纤程的错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1855":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"把解码后的配置交给纤程的更新钩子（`ctx.on_update`、`ctx.on_update_with`）。接管更新的钩子决定更新如何完成，纤程不会重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1856":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"否则纤程重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1857":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"**`restart()`** 递增纤程的修订号，使它以相同配置卸载并重新加载。对已退役的纤程会失败；它也不能恢复 `Failed` 的纤程：在 `update` 或 `registry.replace` 清除错误之前，失败一直保留（`settled()` 也一直返回它）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1858":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"**`dispose()`** 让纤程退役：它被标为已移除，现存的提供立即解除绑定，然后卸载并稳定为 `Disposed`。对根纤程而言，`dispose()` 会重启根，撤销登记在其上的一切；应用就是这样关闭的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1859":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#replace","content":"`ctx.registry()` 用于访问根的插件注册表：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1860":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#replace","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1861":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-152","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#replace","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1862":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-153","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#replace","content":"`registry.replace(&old, &new)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1863":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-154","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#replace","content":"原地替换 `old` 的每个纤程背后的实现，并把以后对 `old` 的实例化转发给 `new`。返回被移动的纤程；每个纤程都以新实现重新加载，并发出 `Replaced`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1864":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-155","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#replace","content":"`registry.size()`、`keys()`、`get(&def)`、`has(&def)`、`fibers(&def)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1865":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-156","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#replace","content":"查询","locale":"zh-CN"},"1866":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-157","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#replace","content":"被移动的纤程保留其标识、父纤程、配置和加载器条目。这是热重载背后的原语，单独使用也很有用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1867":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","type":"page","content":"访客插件","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","使用指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-guests","locale":"zh-CN"},"1868":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests","content":"编写无需重启应用即可热重载的插件：WASM、动态库与进程三种后端，Rust 访客 SDK，失败行为，以及基于 JSON 的访客 ABI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1869":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"1870":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"从 Rust 调用访客","locale":"zh-CN"},"1871":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-guests#sdk","content":"用 Rust 编写访客","locale":"zh-CN"},"1872":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-4","pa