embly（`WasmSource`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1883":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"动态库（`DylibSource`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1884":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"子进程（`ProcessSource`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1885":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1886":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"`.wasm`，或 `.wat` 文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"1887":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"`.so` / `.dylib` / `.dll`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1888":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"可执行文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1889":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"运行方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1890":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"在 wasmtime 上，每个纤程一个 store","locale":"zh-CN"},"1891":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"在宿主（host）进程内","locale":"zh-CN"},"1892":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"每个纤程一个子进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"1893":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"隔离","locale":"zh-CN"},"1894":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"沙箱","locale":"zh-CN"},"1895":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"无：库中的崩溃会使整个应用崩溃","locale":"zh-CN"},"1896":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"崩溃的访客只会让它自己的调用失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"1897":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"重载","locale":"zh-CN"},"1898":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"每个版本编译一次；新旧实例并存，丢弃实例会释放其全部内存","locale":"zh-CN"},"1899":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"每个版本从一份新副本加载，**永不卸载**；一直保留到进程退出","locale":"zh-CN"},"1900":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"重载模块会重新启动其进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"1901":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"适用于","locale":"zh-CN"},"1902":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"生产环境的访客","locale":"zh-CN"},"1903":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"开发：同一套工具链，无需 WASM 目标","locale":"zh-CN"},"1904":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"任意语言编写的访客，或不能让宿主崩溃的访客","locale":"zh-CN"},"1905":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"`kardia` 二进制","locale":"zh-CN"},"1906":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"支持","locale":"zh-CN"},"1907":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"支持","locale":"zh-CN"},"1908":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"暂不支持（仅限库）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1909":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**WebAssembly。** `WasmSource` 在 wasmtime 上运行核心 WebAssembly 模块，而不是 WIT 组件，因此访客不需要组件工具链（测试用 WAT 编写）。模块每个版本编译一次，并为每个纤程在各自的 store 中实例化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1910":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**动态库。** `DylibSource` 使用 C ABI，而不是传递 Rust 类型：`cdylib` 自带一份 `kardia-core` 和 tokio，静态变量各自独立，也没有运行时上下文。每次加载都会把库复制到一个新路径（位于临时目录下的 `kardia-dylib-<pid>` 目录中），因为平台加载器对已知路径会直接交出已加载的那个库。库永不卸载：一旦 Rust 代码注册了线程局部析构函数或交出了 `'static` 引用，卸载它就是不健全的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1911":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**子进程。** `ProcessSource` 把每个插件实例作为独立进程运行，通过 stdin 和 stdout 以 JSON 行的形式使用访客 ABI（见进程传输）。崩溃的访客只会让它自己的调用失败，破坏协议的访客会被杀死。替换可执行文件时，请把新文件重命名覆盖到原路径：正在运行的可执行文件不能被写入，而以写方式打开着的文件不能被启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1912":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**三者的共同点。** 调用是同步的，而不是论文 §6.2 中的异步 RPC：调用会阻塞调用者直到访客应答，所以挂起的访客也会阻塞其调用者。没有单独的代理（broker）服务：每个纤程的 `GuestService` 就是 RPC 端点。这些后端是 `kardia-hmr` 的 cargo 特性（`wasm`、`dylib`、`process`，默认全部开启）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1913":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"`kardia` 二进制按文件扩展名选择后端：`.wasm` 和 `.wat` 交给 `WasmSource`，其他一律交给 `DylibSource`。基于库构建的应用可以自行选择：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1914":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"访客通过 `Host::provide` 提供服务。在宿主一侧，每个这样的服务都是一个 `kardia::hmr::GuestService`，其 JSON 视图就是访客提供的值：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1915":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`GuestService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1916":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`value()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1917":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"访客提供该服务时给出的 JSON 值","locale":"zh-CN"},"1918":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`call(method, args)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1919":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"以 `{ key, method, args }` 调用访客的 `cordis_call`，返回其 JSON 结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"1920":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"提供该服务的纤程消失后，调用以 `the guest instance is disposed` 失败；访客返回的不是 JSON 时，以 `invalid result of <key>.<method>: …` 失败。访客回调到一个已在同一线程上运行的实例（直接或经由其他访客）时，会以 `re-entrant call into a guest instance` 失败，而不会死锁。与任何服务一样，访客的纤程被释放时，访客服务随之撤回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1921":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#sdk","content":"创建一个依赖 `kardia-guest` 的 `cdylib` crate：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1922":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#sdk","conte