ests#deps","content":"`shared.wasm` 变化时，热重载也会重载 `greeter`，因为它导入了发生变化的模块（见 reconcile 事务）。既不导出插件也不导出值的模块什么也不导出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1965":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"访客中的错误或 panic 只会让该插件或该次调用失败：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1966":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"1967":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"访客 panic 时","locale":"zh-CN"},"1968":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"访客消失时","locale":"zh-CN"},"1969":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"dylib","locale":"zh-CN"},"1970":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"SDK 捕获它并作为错误返回：`the guest panicked: <message>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1971":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"崩溃会使宿主崩溃","locale":"zh-CN"},"1972":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"process","locale":"zh-CN"},"1973":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"SDK 捕获它并作为错误返回：`the guest panicked: <message>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1974":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"已退出的进程会让之后的调用以 `the guest process exited` 失败；破坏协议的进程（`invalid message from guest: …`）会被杀死，结果相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"1975":{"id":"/docs/gui