s","content":"结束这次导出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2037":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-169","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"`dispose` 之后进程会被杀死；stdin 关闭时访客退出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2038":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-170","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"例如，上面的 `Counter` 访客在没有配置的情况下被应用，然后被调用一次：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2039":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-171","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#hello","content":"`examples/plugins/hello.wat` 是用 WebAssembly 文本手写的访客。它从 `cordis` 模块导入 `write` 和 `log`，并导出 `memory` 和三个函数：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2040":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-172","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#hello","content":"`cordis_meta` 写出 `{\"plugin\":{\"name\":\"hello\"}}`：一个名为 `hello` 的插件，没有依赖、注入或提供。它返回 `0`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2041":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-173","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#hello","content":"`cordis_apply` 忽略其输入（从不 `read` 消息），并以级别 `2`（info）记录 `hello from wasm`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2042":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-174","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#hello","content":"`cordis_dispose` 记录 `goodbye from wasm`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2043":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-175","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#hello","content":"没有 `cordis_call`，因为该插件不提供任何服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2044":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-176","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#hello","content":"用 `cargo run -p kardia -- examples/kardia.yml` 运行它并编辑问候语：`hmr` 会原地重载该模块，于是旧实例先记录道别，新实例再记录你的问候语。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2045":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"page","content":"热重载","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","使用指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","locale":"zh-CN"},"2046":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","content":"用 hmr 插件原地重载访客模块：配置监视模式，搭建模块图，运行 reconcile 事务，并了解失败如何处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2047":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"监视访客模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"2048":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#setup","content":"在应用中启用热重载","locale":"zh-CN"},"2049":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"模块与模块图","locale":"zh-CN"},"2050":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#host","content":"宿主模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"2051":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"reconcile 事务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2052":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"`ReconcileResult`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2053":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"重载如何替换插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2054":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"监视模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2055":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","content":"编译进二进制的插件可以在运行时重新配置，但修改其代码需要重启。**访客插件**（guest plugin）是独立的模块，`hmr` 插件（`kardia-hmr`）可以原地重载它们：模块变化时，它导出的插件会在其运行中的纤程（fiber）背后被替换，应用的其余部分随之跟进。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2056":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","content":"Rust 没有模块注册表（registry），因此由宿主（host）自己维护一个：`ModuleGraph` 从 `ModuleSource` 加载模块代码。`Hmr` 服务重载发生变化的模块，并通过 `registry.replace` 原地替换它们导出的插件；开启 `watch.enabled`（并有 `fs` 服务）时，它会随文件变化自动这样做。如何编写模块本身见访客插件；调和过程如何实现见加载器内部实现，TypeScript 原版见 HMR。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2057":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"要在访客模块变化时重载它们，在配置文件中加入一个开启监视模式的 `hmr` 条目：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2058":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`HmrConfig`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2059":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"2060":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2061":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2062":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2063":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`.`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2064":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"基准目录。相对的 `base` 相对于加载 `hmr` 条目的那个配置文件所在目录解析（与 TypeScript 代码使用 `ctx.baseUrl` 的方式相同），否则相对于工作目录。`watch.files` 和日志中的路径都相对于它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2065":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`watch.enabled`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2066":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`false`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2067":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"文件变化时重载。需要 `fs` 服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2068":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`watch.files`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2069":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`[\".\", \"!**/.*\", \"!**/target\"]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2070":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"要监视的文件：相对于 `base` 的模式，与 `fs` 监视过滤器的写法相同。前导 `!` 表示排除，匹配某路径或其某个祖先的最后一个模式起决定作用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2071":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`watch.debounce`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2072":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`100`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2073":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"在这么多毫秒内发生的变化一起重载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2074":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"开启 `watch.enabled` 且 `files` 列表非空时，`hmr` 记录 `watching [..] in <base>`，并在自身之下启动一个等待 `fs` 的监视。若 `fs` 已存在，监视会在 `hmr` 稳定之前建立好；建立失败会被记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2075":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`kardia` 二进制注册了 `hmr`（也以 `@cordisjs/plugin-hmr` 注册），并把任何不是内置插件的条目名解析为相对于配置文件的访客模块，所以 `examples/kardia.yml` 会热重载 `plugins/hello.wat`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2076":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#setup","content":"`ModuleGraph` 同时也是一个 `Resolver`，因此加载器（loader）可以通过它解析条目名；`Hmr::plugin(graph)` 是基于同一个图的 `hmr` 插件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2077":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#setup","content":"若要同时使用内置插件和访客模块，像二进制那样先经插件目录解析、再经模块图解析即可（见加载器）。若要通过加载器的配置文件重载，在目录中以 `hmr` 注册 `Hmr::plugin(graph)`，再加入一个 `hmr` 条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2078":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"**模块**由 `ModuleId` 标识，即一个绝对路径（`/app/plugins/foo.wasm`）。其代码来自 `ModuleSource`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2079":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"模块的 `evaluate` 通过 `Imports` 拿到其依赖的导出（`imports.get(id)`；对导出值的依赖可用 `imports.value(id)`），并返回它自己导出的内容。`ModuleCode::new(deps, evaluate)` 用于构造。除自定义来源外，还有三个从文件加载访客模块的后端：`WasmSource`、`DylibSource` 和 `ProcessSource`（见访客插件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2080":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`ModuleGraph` 是宿主维护的模块注册表，相当于参考实现中 Node 的模块缓存：已加载的模块、它们之间的边以及它们的导出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2081":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2082":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2083":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`ModuleGraph::new(source)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2084":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"基于某个来源的模块图","locale":"zh-CN"},"2085":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`graph.import(id)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2086":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"导入一个模块及其依赖（依赖先导入）并缓存。在环中，仍在导入过程中的模块被视为 `Exports::None`。加载失败的模块不会被保留，所以下次导入会重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2087":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`graph.resolve(name)`（作为 `Resolver`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2088":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"导入 `name` 并返回其插件；否则以 `module <name> does not export a plugin` 失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2089":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`graph.mark_host(ids)`、`graph.is_host(id)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2090":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"宿主模块（见下文）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2091":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`graph.is_loaded(id)`、`graph.loaded()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2092":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"已加载的内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2093":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`graph.edges(id)`、`graph.exports(id)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2094":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"某个已加载模块的依赖和导出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2095":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#host","content":"静态链接的插件天然就是**宿主模块**：程序本身只能通过重启来改变，而这些插件的运行时*重新*配置仍完全由加载器支持。如果你把宿主的某些部分建模为图中的模块，请用 `graph.mark_host(ids)` 标记它们。对宿主模块的修改不会被应用；它会在 `ReconcileResult::skipped_host_modules` 中报告，监视模式会给出警告：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2096":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#host","content":"宿主模块发出的边不会让它们随所导入的模块一起重载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2097":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"`HmrExt::reconcile` 在 `Hmr` 服务上运行一次**事务**。其回调报告发生变化的文件或目录（绝对路径）；位于其中某个路径或其下方的每个已加载模块（按完整路径段比较）都会被重载：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2098":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"不是绝对路径的根会使事务失败：`invalid root <path>, expected an absolute path`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2099":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"事务一次只运行一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2100":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"在另一个事务内部（在其回调中，或在正被运行中的事务重载的插件中）启动事务，会以 `cannot start a transaction inside another transaction` 失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2101":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"事务遵循参考代码（而不是论文的算法 10）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2102":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**匹配。** 发生变化的模块是位于所报告的根或其下方的已加载模块；其中的宿主模块只做报告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2103":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**接受。** 发生变化的模块，以及导入了某个已接受模块的每个模块（宿主模块除外），都被接受。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2104":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**过期插件。** 模块闭包触及某个已接受模块的每个已注册插件都是过期的。由多个模块导出的插件（例如某个模块重新导出了它）从最外层的导出者取得替换，即没有被其他导出者导入的那个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2105":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**阶段 1：导入。** 驱逐过期插件的模块，并重新导入每个过期插件。这是唯一可能失败的步骤；有效性在这里检查，此时只有模块缓存发生了变化，所以后续阶段无需回滚。在所有插件都导入完之前不恢复任何内容，因此没有新模块会链接到被驱逐的旧模块。导入错误会被记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2106":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**单元。** 闭包（在旧图或新图中）共享某个被驱逐模块的插件组成一个**单元**，一起提交或一起放弃。含导入失败的单元被放弃：其中任何内容都不会应用，其模块的缓存条目会被恢复；其他单元不受影响。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2107":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**阶段 2：替换。** 每个已提交的插件都通过 `registry.replace` 原地替换，并记录为 `reload plugin at <module>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2108":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**阶段 3：稳定。** 被替换的纤程并发地稳定下来。不做回滚：应用失败的插件保持失败，与冷启动时一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2109":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"2110":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2111":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"`settled_fibers: Vec<Fiber>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2112":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"被替换且已稳定的纤程（位于另一个被重载纤程之下的纤程可能已被它释放，不包含在内）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2113":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"`import_failures: Vec<ImportFailure>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2114":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"每个被放弃的单元一项","locale":"zh-CN"},"2115":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"`skipped_host_modules: Vec<ModuleId>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2116":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"发生变化的宿主模块，只有重启才能应用它们；其他变化都已应用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2117":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"`ImportFailure` 包含 `modules`（该单元中被驱逐的模块，已排序，其缓存条目已恢复）和 `error`（该单元中某个模块导入失败的原因；若它不再导出插件，则为 `invalid plugin at <module>, expect a plugin export`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2118":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"替换经由 `registry.replace` 进行，因此插件的每个纤程都保留其标识、父纤程、配置和加载器条目；只有背后的实现改变。纤程先卸载（其效应，包括旧的访客实例，都被释放），然后加载新实现。对 `hello.wat` 而言，旧实例先记录道别，然后新实例记录新的问候语。访客会得到一个状态全新的新实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2119":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"可能出错的情况及其结果：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2120":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2121":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2122":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"变化后的模块无法加载，或不再导出插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2123":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"其单元被放弃：其中任何内容都不重载，旧模块仍留在缓存中，运行中的插件继续使用旧代码。其他单元照常重载。在监视模式下，它的文件会在下一批中重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2124":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"新实现在 `apply` 中失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2125":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"纤程变为 `Failed`，与冷启动时一样；不做回滚。之后再次重载该模块（或 `update` 该条目）可以恢复它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2126":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"事务本身失败（错误的根、嵌套事务、回调失败）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2127":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"什么都不重载；返回该错误（在监视模式下记录为警告，并重试所有文件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2128":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"在监视模式下，`hmr` 通过 `fs` 服务监视 `base`，把文件变化转化为事务：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2129":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"每次变化都以调试级别记录（`change detected at <path>`，路径相对于 `base`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2130":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"变化会被收集，直到连续 `debounce` 毫秒没有新的变化；该窗口内的变化作为一批一起重载（`reconcile N changed files`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2131":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"各批次一次运行一个，每一批都会接手上一批保留下来的文件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2132":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"导入失败的文件在下一批中重试（其导入失败已由事务记录）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2133":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"若事务本身失败，它的所有文件都会重试，错误记录为警告；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2134":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"对宿主模块的修改只做报告（`skipped host modules: …`），因为是否重启由宿主决定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2135":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"监视是 `hmr` 纤程之下的一个效应（effect），随它一起结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2136":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"page","content":"加载器","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","使用指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader","locale":"zh-CN"},"2137":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader","content":"用声明式条目运行插件：搭建加载器及其插件目录，从 Rust 驱动树、分组与条目，以双向同步的方式引入配置文件，并定位配置错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2138":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"搭建加载器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2139":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"条目、分组与树","locale":"zh-CN"},"2140":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#api","content":"从 Rust 驱动加载器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2141":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"`Loader`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2142":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#handles","content":"`TreeHandle`、`GroupHandle`、`EntryHandle`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2143":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"创建、更新、移动与移除","locale":"zh-CN"},"2144":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#backends","content":"树后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"2145":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#isolation","content":"通过条目隔离与拦截","locale":"zh-CN"},"2146":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"引入配置文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2147":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#patches","content":"补丁","locale":"zh-CN"},"2148":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#writes","content":"写入与冲突","locale":"zh-CN"},"2149":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"`Include` 句柄","locale":"zh-CN"},"2150":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#errors","content":"定位配置错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"2151":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#patch-context","content":"`on_patch_context` 钩子","locale":"zh-CN"},"2152":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader","content":"**加载器**（loader，`kardia-loader`）维护一棵由**条目**（entry，即插件名加上其配置）组成的树，并让它与运行中的纤程（fiber）双向保持一致：对条目的修改会被调和到运行中的纤程，插件自行更新或释放（dispose）时也会被回写到它的条目。**include**（配置文件引入）插件（`kardia-include`）把 YAML 或 JSON 文件中的条目嫁接到这棵树上，并让文件双向保持同步。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2153":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader","content":"本页是库使用者的视角：如何搭建加载器、从 Rust 驱动它、引入文件、查找配置错误。条目字段本身（`id`、`name`、`config`、`group`、`disabled`、`inject`、`intercept`、`isolate`）和表达式列在配置文件中。加载器如何实现见加载器内部实现，它与 TypeScript 加载器的所有不同之处列在状态与偏差中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2154":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`Loader::plugin(resolver)` 返回加载器插件。它运行后提供 `loader` 服务：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2155":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"**解析名称。** 加载器通过 `Resolver` 把条目的 `name` 转换成 `PluginDef`，相当于模块导入。解析可以是异步的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2156":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`Catalog` 是静态解析器：按名称组织的插件注册表（registry）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2157":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`Catalog` 方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2158":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2159":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`Catalog::new()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2160":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"空目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2161":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`catalog.register::<P>()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2162":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"以 `P::NAME` 注册一个类型化插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2163":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`catalog.register_def(name, def)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2164":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"以给定名称注册一个 `PluginDef`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2165":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`catalog.alias(alias, name)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2166":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"让 `alias` 解析为 `name` 所解析的插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2167":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`catalog.get(name)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2168":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"查找一个名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"2169":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"找不到的名称以 `ModuleNotFound`（`Cannot find plugin 'name'`）失败，加载器报告它时会定位到条目的 `name`（见定位配置错误）。`kardia_loader::builtins()` 是一个含 `group` 插件（也以 `@cordisjs/plugin-group` 注册）的目录；`kardia::catalog()` 在此之上加入 `timer`、`logger-console`、`fs` 和 `include`，每个也以其 TypeScript 包名注册。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2170":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"解析器可以组合多种来源。`kardia` 二进制从其目录中解析内置插件，并把其他任何名称视为相对于配置文件的访客模块路径：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2171":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`Loader::plugin_with(resolver, backend)` 还可以设置加载器自身那棵树的后端（见树后端）；`Loader::plugin` 使用 `MemoryTree`，只把树保存在内存中。`crates/kardia/src/main.rs` 展示了二进制的完整搭建过程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2172":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**条目**是一个由选项组成的 JSON 对象。JSON 始终是事实来源，因此未知键会被容忍并在回写时保留。键保持稳定的顺序：`id`、`name`，其余按字母序，`config` 最后。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2173":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**分组**（group）是带 `group: true`、运行 `group` 插件的条目。它的 `config` 是一个条目列表，分组在每次更新时原地调和这个列表而不是重启：条目按 id 并发地创建、更新和移除，一个坏条目不会阻止其他条目。分组本身从不被禁用；它的 `disabled` 判定会传给其成员。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2174":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**树**（tree）是一组共用一个后端的分组，后端负责持久化它的变化。加载器自己的树位于内存中。插件可以创建子树（`loader.create_tree(ctx, backend)`）；include 为每个文件这样做。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2175":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**id** 在一棵树内唯一。没有 id 的条目会得到一个随机的八位十六进制 id。在嵌套的树之间，条目有一个**复合 id**：各层树所有者的 id 和它自己的 id 用 `:`（`kardia_loader::SEP`）连接，如 `include:hmr`；因此 `id` 不得包含 `:`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2176":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**类型化视图。** `EntryOptions::read(&options)` 把已校验的选项读成类型化视图（`id`、`name`、`config`、`group`、`disabled: Option<Disabled>`（其中 `Disabled::{Bool, Expr}`）、`inject`、`intercept`、`isolate: Vec<(String, IsolateLabel)>`（其中 `IsolateLabel::{Private, Shared(label)}`））；JSON 对象仍是事实来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2177":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**带 `inject` 的条目有两个纤程。** 声明了 `inject` 的条目运行一个外层纤程（标记为 `loader:outer`，即 `kardia_loader::OUTER_TAG`），它持有依赖、解析插件、通过一次 `ctx.checkpoint()?`，然后启动运行插件的内层纤程。没有 `inject` 的条目只有内层纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2178":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**条目何时运行。** 字面量 `disabled: true` 或被禁用的祖先分组会阻止条目运行。`disabled` 表达式在外层纤程的上下文（context）中求值（该上下文能看到条目的 `inject`）；求值失败时条目被禁用，并报告失败。接着对条目的 `intercept` 求值；`intercept` 无法求值时插件不会运行。`config` 中的表达式在每次加载时于插件的上下文中插值，源配置保留表达式本身；分组的 `config` 是其条目列表，不做插值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2179":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#api","content":"加载器有三类句柄：`TreeHandle`、`GroupHandle` 和 `EntryHandle`。`Loader` 自己的 `create`、`remove`、`update`、`resolve`、`entries` 和 `root` 作用于它自己的树。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2180":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2181":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2182":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"`Loader::plugin(resolver)` / `Loader::plugin_with(resolver, backend)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2183":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"加载器插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2184":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"`loade