uide-loader#crud","content":"更新对运行中插件的影响取决于改了什么：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2249":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"`name` 或 `inject` 改变，或条目未在运行：重建条目（先释放它的纤程，再重新启动）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2250":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"否则就地修补运行中的纤程：条目连同新的隔离表被重新挂到它（新的）分组之下（重新挂接条目的上下文时，其下的所有纤程也随之移动，就像重新指向的 JavaScript 原型），`intercept` 原地替换，改变后的 `config` 以 `fiber.update_with(config, true)` 的形式到达插件，插件的更新钩子可以接管它而不重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2251":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"**`remove(id)`** 释放条目，并把它从所在分组中移除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2252":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"**回写。** 插件对自身的修改会到达它的条目：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2253":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"自行释放的插件被持久化为 `disabled: true`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2254":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"自行更新配置的插件（`fiber.update(..)`，它会发出 `ConfigCommitted`）会把新的 `config` 写入其条目；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2255":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"依赖丢失会卸载条目的外层纤程但不释放它；此后在外层纤程重新激活之前，条目被视为禁用，且不写入任何内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2256":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"应用到树上的每个变化都会在应用之后以 `EntryChange` 的形式报告给它的后端：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2257":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"`EntryChange` 字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"2258":{"id":"/docs/guide-loade