:"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#backends","content":"`handle()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2282":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#backends","content":"`None`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2283":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#backends","content":"树背后的对象，供其所有者再次找到它","locale":"zh-CN"},"2284":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#backends","content":"`locate(id, path, value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2285":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#backends","content":"`None`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2286":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#backends","content":"条目 `id` 的选项中 `path` 处的值写在哪里；给出 `value` 时，仅当写在那里的正是这个值；不给时，缺失的值定位到其最近的已写出祖先","locale":"zh-CN"},"2287":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#backends","content":"`locate_expr(id, path, expr, offset)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2288":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#backends","content":"`None`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2289":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-152","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#backends","content":"`path` 处的表达式 `expr` 的第 `offset` 个字符写在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"2290":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-153","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#isolation","content":"条目以声明方式建立隔离（isolation）和拦截（interception）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2291":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-154","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#isolation","content":"**`isolate`** 给条目的服务一个自己的领域（realm）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2292":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-155","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#isolation","content":"`isolate: { db: true }` 使 `db` 成为该条目私有；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2293":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-156","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#isolation","content":"`isolate: { db: shared }` 把 `db` 放进一个由所有使用标签 `shared` 的条目共享的领域。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2294":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-157","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#isolation","content":"（TypeScript 加载器把这些领域命名为 `db#<id>` 和 `db@shared`；在 kardia 中它们只是普通的 `RealmId`，打印为 `realm#<n>`。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2295":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-158","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#isolation","content":"当条目的有效领域改变时（新的 `isolate`，或移到另一个分组），从条目内部提供的绑定会**迁移**到新领域，而不重启其提供者，前提是新领域空闲；两个领域的消费者都会重新解析。某个共享领域在不再有条目对该服务使用它的标签时被释放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2296":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-159","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#isolation","content":"**`intercept`** 是条目的插件所用服务的元数据，按服务分键：`intercept: { logger: { name: db, level: 3 } }`。它会被求值（可以包含表达式）并原地替换，所以运行中的插件无需重启就能看到新元数据。`intercept` 求值失败会禁用条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2297":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-160","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#isolation","content":"**`inject`** 写成映射时，可为声明的依赖附加元数据：`inject: { loader: { await: true } }`。元数据可以包含表达式，在父分组的上下文中求值；失败会禁用条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2298":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-161","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"`include` 插件（`kardia_include::IncludePlugin`）把 YAML 或 JSON 文件中的条目作为子树加载，并让文件双向保持同步。它声明依赖 `loader` 服务；开启 `watch` 时还需要 `fs`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2299":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-162","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"2300":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-163","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2301":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-164","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"`path`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2302":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-165","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"文件路径，相对于 include 条目所在树的基准目录（嵌套 include 时为引入它的文件所在目录）；扩展名为 `.json`、`.yaml` 或 `.yml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2303":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-166","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"`watch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2304":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-167","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"文件变化时重新读取（需要 `fs` 服务）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2305":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-168","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"`initial`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2306":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-169","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"文件尚不存在时写入的条目","locale":"zh-CN"},"2307":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-170","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"`patches`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2308":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-171","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"叠加在文件之上的覆盖与追加（见下文）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2309":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-172","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"**启动。** include 读取文件。若文件不存在且设置了 `initial`，它写入 `initial`（并分配 id）后再读取；没有 `initial` 时以 `config file not found: <path>` 失败。其他任何读取、解析或校验失败都会使插件失败，不支持的扩展名同样如此（`extension \"toml\" not supported`）。文件必须是由对象组成的顶层数组。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2310":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-173","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"**文件编辑 → 树。** 每次读取都会调和进子树；只应用最新的目标树，较旧的被跳过。编辑过程中无法解析的文件（编辑时出现空文件或截断的文件很常见）会记录为警告，运行中的树保持不变，并且在之后某次读取成功之前不写入任何内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2311":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-174","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"**树的变化 → 文件。** 子树在运行时的变化（API 编辑、插件自行更新与自行释放）记录在一个日志（journal）中，并回写给拥有它们的一方：文件，或 include 自身配置中的某个补丁；后者通过 include 在父树中的条目持久化。关闭应用不会写入文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2312":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-175","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"**匿名条目。** 文件中没有 id 的条目会在加载器看到它们之前得到 id，id 也会被回写。与上次读取中某个条目完全相同的匿名条目会保留那个 id（除非文件现在显式命名了它），所以编辑相邻条目不会让它重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2313":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-176","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#patches","content":"`patches` 让父文件无需编辑被引入的文件就能调整它：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2314":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-177","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#patches","content":"补丁","locale":"zh-CN"},"2315":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-178","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#patches","content":"效果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2316":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-179","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#patches","content":"`{ insert: [..] }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2317":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-180","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#patches","content":"把条目追加到被引入文件的根","locale":"zh-CN"},"2318":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-181","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#patches","content":"`{ id, insert: [..] }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2319":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-182","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#patches","content":"把条目追加到分组 `id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2320":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-183","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#patches","content":"`{ id, name?, ..keys }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2321":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-184","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#patches","content":"覆盖条目 `id` 的若干键","locale":"zh-CN"},"2322":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-185","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#patches","content":"无法应用的补丁（`patch insert: entry x not found`、`… is not a group`）会报告为警告，且不拥有任何内容。每个插入的条目都会得到 id，以便运行时的变化能被路由回它。include 记录每个条目和每个键由谁提供（文件、覆盖该键的补丁，或写在补丁内部的条目），并把补丁所拥有的值在运行时的变化写入补丁而非文件。更新 include 的配置时，新的 `patches` 原地生效；`path` 或 `watch` 改变则会让它重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2323":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-186","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#writes","content":"**原子写入。** include 在同一目录中写一个临时文件（`.<name>.<pid>.<seq>.tmp`），再把它重命名覆盖原文件，因此读者永远不会看到被截断的文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2324":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-187","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#writes","content":"**过期内容检查。** 每次重命名之前，它都检查文件是否仍是它上次读到的内容。若期间有人写过文件，它先读取并合并，然后再写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2325":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-188","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#writes","content":"**暂时性失败。** 以 `PermissionDenied` 或 `ResourceBusy` 失败的重命名（例如杀毒软件占用了文件）最多重试 10 次，每次多等待 20 ms。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2326":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-189","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#writes","content":"**只读或缺失的文件。** 变化保留在内存中，并给出警告：`config file <path> is read-only, N pending change(s) kept in memory`（或 `is missing`）。写入失败时记录 `failed to write config file <path>, N pending change(s) kept in memory`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2327":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-190","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#writes","content":"**冲突：以文件为准。** 运行时变化尚未写出时文件发生了变化，include 会做三方合并。冲突的运行时变化被丢弃，使树跟随文件，每次丢弃都记录为 `config conflict in <path>: entry <id> <reason>; file wins`，原因是以下之一：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2328":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-191","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#writes","content":"`key \"k\" modified both in file and at runtime`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2329":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-192","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#writes","content":"`removed in file, modified at runtime`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2330":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-193","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#writes","content":"`modified in file, removed at runtime`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2331":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-194","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#writes","content":"`added in file, removed at runtime`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2332":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-195","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#writes","content":"`moved both in file and at runtime`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2333":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-196","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"`Include::of(&tree)` 返回创建了某棵树的那个运行中的 include：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2334":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-197","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2335":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-198","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2336":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-199","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"`include.filename()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2337":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-200","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"文件的绝对路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"2338":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-201","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"`include.tree()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2339":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-202","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"它的 `TreeHandle`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2340":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-203","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"`include.refresh().await`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2341":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-204","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"重新读取文件并把树与它调和（监视器触发的就是这个），然后等待所有待处理的读写","locale":"zh-CN"},"2342":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-205","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"`include.flush().await`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2343":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-206","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"在所有待处理的读写都处理完毕、树已反映其结果时完成","locale":"zh-CN"},"2344":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-207","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"`include.stop().await`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2345":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-208","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"先刷新用户最后所做的修改，再移除树的条目","locale":"zh-CN"},"2346":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-209","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"`IncludePlugin::with_rename(rename)` 是用自定义重命名函数代替 `std::fs::rename` 的插件，用于故障注入测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2347":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-210","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"在 YAML 中，`!!js <source>` 读作表达式对象 `{ \"__jsExpr\": source }`，并按同样方式写回。未知标签是错误，因为它们会让数据不完整。写出的 YAML 使用块样式，必要时使用单引号字符串。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2348":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-211","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#errors","content":"配置文件中的错误会以 `file:line:col` 指向它所涉及的位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2349":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-212","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#errors","content":"文件的**读取、解析与校验错误**是一个 `ConfigFileError { stage, path, cause, issues }`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2350":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-213","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#errors","content":"第一行给出阶段（`read`、`parse` 或 `validate`），读取失败时还给出原因；之后每个问题附带其位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2351":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-214","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#errors","content":"加载器记录的**条目错误**（选项与配置校验、`ModuleNotFound`、表达式失败）通过树后端的 `locate` / `locate_expr` 定位。每个问题带上 `(at <path>, file:line:col)`，表达式失败带上一个 `at <path> (file:line:col)` 帧，条目及其每个有位置的祖先各带一个 `at <id> (file:line:col)` 帧：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2352":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-215","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#errors","content":"值如何被定位：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2353":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-216","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#errors","content":"include 在值的所有者写它的地方定位它：在自己的文件中，或在父文件中的某个补丁里；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2354":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-217","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#errors","content":"YAML 别名定位到其锚点；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2355":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-218","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#errors","content":"表达式中的字符会穿过 YAML 转义定位；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2356":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-219","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#errors","content":"缺失的值定位到本应持有它的键（其最近的已写出祖先）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2357":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-220","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#errors","content":"JSON 文件也会被