ext","url":"/docs/guide-loader#patch-context","content":"`EntryHandle::init().await` 在条目未运行时启动它，或加入其进行中的启动；并发调用者共享同一次启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2367":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","type":"page","content":"编写插件","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","使用指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-plugins","locale":"zh-CN"},"2368":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins","content":"用 Rust 编写服务和插件：#[derive(Service)]、#[plugin]、Plugin trait、PluginDef，以及为加载器注册插件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2369":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-plugins#add-the-dependency","content":"添加依赖","locale":"zh-CN"},"2370":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"第一个示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2371":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-plugins#services","content":"服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2372":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"提供服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2373":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-plugins#services-for-expressions","content":"用于表达式的服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2374":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"使用服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2375":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugins","content":"插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2376":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"在 async 函数上使用 `#[plugin]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2377":{"id":"/docs/g