context）可以不受检查地访问实时存储。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2435":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"带类型的访问返回 `Svc<S>`，它解引用为 `S`，并记住发起访问的上下文（调用者）。`timer` 之类的服务利用调用者，把它们代你完成的工作记为*你的*插件的效应；调用者归属、拦截和事件见服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2436":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugins","content":"插件就是论文中的组件（component）`(d, p, e)`：它依赖的服务（`d`）、它提供的服务（`p`），以及它运行时执行的效应（`e`）。编写插件有四种方式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2437":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"函数必须是 `async`，并返回 `Result<()>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2438":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"第一个参数是 `Context`（不声明依赖）或 `Injected<(A, B, …)>`（声明 `A`、`B`……，最多八个）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2439":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"可选的第二个参数是配置，类型为 `Arc<Config>`。没有它时，插件不接受配置（`()`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2440":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"宏会生成一个以函数名的驼峰形式命名的插件类型（`hello_world` → `HelloWorld`，`user` → `User`），并保留原函数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2441":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"参数：`name` 设置插件名（默认是连字符形式的函数名，即 `hello-world`），`provide` 列出它提供的键，`crate` 是 kardia crate 的路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2442":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"使用 `Injected<D>` 时，只有 `S` 在 `D` 中，`ctx.get::<S, _>()` 才能编译（`_` 是 `S` 在 `D` 中的位置，由编译器推断）。`Injected` 解引用为 `Context`，因此 `Context` 的其他方法都能使用；`ctx.context()` 给出不受检查的上下文。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2443":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-trait","content":"（`Key` 是 `kardia::Key`，`Arc` 是 `std::sync::Arc`。）该 trait 的定义：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2444":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-trait","content":"`provide()` 本身不提供任何东西：插件仍需在 `apply` 中调用 `ctx.provide`。这个声明让 kardia 能在插件启动时检测依赖环，并以警告的形式记录下来，列出环中的插件（它们保持等待状态），而不是让它们悄无声息地一直等待。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2445":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#inject","content":"`Inject` 是一个有序的服务键列表，每个键可以带有拦截元数据：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2446":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#inject","content":"插件在每个声明的服务都可用后启动，在某个服务被替换时重启，在某个服务消失时停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2447":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-def","content":"`PluginDef` 是运行时（runtime）所存储的类型擦除形式。可以用闭包构造它：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2448":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-def","content":"构造函数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2449":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-def","content":"配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2450":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-def","content":"注册表（registry）身份","locale":"zh-CN"},"2451":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-def","content":"`PluginDef::of::<P>()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2452":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-def","content":"`P::C