lugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#fiber-handle","content":"`update_with(value, no_save)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2496":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#fiber-handle","content":"同上；`no_save: true` 跳过写回配置文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2497":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#fiber-handle","content":"`restart().await`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2498":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#fiber-handle","content":"卸载并重新加载插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2499":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#fiber-handle","content":"`dispose().await`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2500":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#fiber-handle","content":"停止并移除插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2501":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#fiber-handle","content":"`error()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2502":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#fiber-handle","content":"上一次加载失败的错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"2503":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#fiber-handle","content":"`context()`、`config()`、`name()`、`parent()`、`effects()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2504":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#fiber-handle","content":"内省","locale":"zh-CN"},"2505":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#fiber-handle","content":"处于 `Failed` 状态的插件只能通过 `update`、`restart` 或替换来恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2506":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#configuration","content":"配置以 JSON 形式进入（来自配置文件、`plugin_value` 或 `update`），每次加载时用 serde 解码一次，得到 `Config`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2507":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#configuration","content":"解码错误会指出失败的路径，例如 `invalid config: … (at items.1)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2508":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#configuration","content":"未知字段会被容忍，除非配置类型显式启用 `#[serde(deny_unknown_fields)]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2509":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#configuration","content":"缺失的配置（`null`）按空对象读取，因此所有字段都有默认值（`#[serde(default)]`）的配置类型可以接受它。`()` 接受任何值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2510":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#configuration","content":"`fiber.update(value)` 先校验新配置：被拒绝的配置不会影响运行中的实例。新配置随后交给插件的更新钩子；如果没有钩子接管，插件就会重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2511":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#configuration","content":"`ctx.on_update_with` 作用相同，但它的钩子返回一个 future，`update` 会等待这个 future 完成。钩子是一个效应，因此会随插件一同消失。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2512":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#stopping-cleanly","content":"插件通过其上下文注册的一切都是效应，在插件停止时被撤销：提供的服务、监听器、定时器、子插件，以及 `ctx.on_dispose(…)` 这样的普通撤销函数（disposer）。效应的完整介绍见效应；编写 `apply` 时有两点需要注意：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2513":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#stopping-cleanly","content":"**获取资源后立即注册它的逆操作**，这样插件在启动过程中被停止时也不会泄漏任何东西。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2514":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#stopping-cleanly","content":"**`ctx.checkpoint()?`** 是过时的加载在此停止的位置。如果插件的目标在本次加载开始后发生了变化（被更新、被释放或失去了某个依赖），它返回 `Err(Interrupted)`。从 `apply` 返回这个错误并不算失败：插件会卸载它目前为止注册的内容。kardia 自身从不取消正在运行的 `apply`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2515":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#loading-your-plugins-from-a-config-file","content":"加载器（loader）负责解析每个条目的 `name`。要从配置文件加载你自己的插件，把它们注册到一个 `kardia::loader::Catalog` 中，再传给 `Loader::plugin`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2516":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#loading-your-plugins-from-a-config-file","content":"`kardia::catalog()` 包含除 `hmr` 以外的所有内置插件（`hmr` 需要一个模块图，见热重载），每个插件同时以自己的名字和对应的 TypeScript 包名注册；`kardia::loader::builtins()` 只包含 `group`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2517":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#loading-your-plugins-from-a-config-file","content":"不在目录中的条目名会以 `ModuleNotFound` 失败，错误位置指向该条目的 `name`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2518":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#loading-your-plugins-from-a-config-file","content":"`Loader::plugin` 接受任何 `kardia::loader::Resolver`，`Catalog` 就是其中一种。`kardia` 可执行文件使用自己的解析器，对不是内置插件的名字回退到访客模块：完整的配置方式（包括 `hmr`）见 `crates/kardia/src/main.rs`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2519":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#next","content":"<Card title=\"服务\" href=\"/docs/guide-services\" description=\"调用者归属、拦截、事件与日志。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2520":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-152","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#next","content":"<Card title=\"效应\" href=\"/docs/guide-effects\" description=\"效应、撤销函数、效应作用域与拆除。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2521":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-153","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#next","content":"<Card title=\"加载器\" href=\"/docs/guide-loader\" description=\"在 Rust 中使用条目、分组、隔离与 include。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2522":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-154","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#next","content":"<Card title=\"API 设计\" href=\"/docs/development-design\" description=\"插件 API 为什么是现在这个样子。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2523":{"id":"/docs/guide-services","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"page","content":"服务、事件与日志","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","使用指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services","locale":"zh-CN"},"2524":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services","content":"提供与使用服务，把调用归属到调用者，隔离与拦截服务，派发事件，记录日志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2525":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#defining","content":"定义服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2526":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"提供服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2527":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"声明依赖","locale":"zh-CN"},"2528":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"访问服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2529":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#injected","content":"编译期受检访问","locale":"zh-CN"},"2530":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`Svc<T>` 与调用者","locale":"zh-CN"},"2531":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#interception","content":"拦截元数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"2532":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"隔离","locale":"zh-CN"},"2533":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#events","content":"事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2534":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#listening","content":"监听","locale":"zh-CN"},"2535":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#dispatching","content":"派发","locale":"zh-CN"},"2536":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#builtin-events","content":"内置事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2537":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#hooks","content":"钩子","locale":"zh-CN"},"2538":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#logging","content":"日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"2539":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#exporters","content":"导出器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2540":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-services#example","content":"完整示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2541":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services","content":"**服务**（service）是由一个插件提供、被其他插件依赖的值。运行时（runtime）记录谁提供了什么、谁依赖什么：声明了某个服务的插件会在服务可用时启动，在服务被替换时重启，在服务消失时停止。本页介绍如何定义、提供和使用服务，调用如何归属到调用者，隔离（isolation）与拦截（interception）如何改变一个上下文（context）看到的内容，以及如何使用事件和日志器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2542":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services","content":"服务背后的理论见响应式余效应；Rust API 为何如此设计（字符串键、`Svc<T>`、不用 `Proxy`）见 API 设计；kardia 与 TypeScript 版 Cordis 行为不同的所有地方列在状态与偏差中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2543":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#defining","content":"服务是任意通过 `Service` trait 绑定到某个**键**（key）的 `Send + Sync + 'static` 类型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2544":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#defining","content":"键是字符串，因为配置文件要按名字引用服务（`inject: [database]`）。运行时把每个值和它的类型一起存储，因此用错误的 Rust 类型访问某个键会得到 `AccessError::TypeMismatch`，而不会读错数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2545":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#defining","content":"通常用派生宏实现这个 trait：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2546":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#defining","content":"不写 `name` 时，键是连字符化的类型名：`Database` → `database`，`FooBar` → `foo-bar`。`#[service(crate = …)]` 让生成的代码指向 `::kardia`；不写时指向 `::kardia_core`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2547":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#defining","content":"**关联服务。** Cordis 的 `foo.bar` 关联服务和 `ctx.mixin` 是 JavaScript 对象层面的便利功能。在 kardia 中，名为 `foo.bar` 的服务只是另一个键。要\"扩展\"另一个插件的类型，可以用扩展 trait（编译期，见 `Svc<T>` 与调用者），或用基于 `kardia_core::IdTable` 的注册表（registry）服务（运行期）。访问器或 mixin 层没有移植。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2548":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"提供服务是当前纤程（fiber）的一个**效应**（effect）：纤程卸载时它会被撤销（见可撤销效应）。下列方法都返回 `Result<EffectHandle>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2549":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2550":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"提供的内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2551":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"`ctx.provide(value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2552":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"以 `S::NAME` 为键的一个 `Service`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2553":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"`ctx.provide_arc(arc)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2554":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"你已持有的 `Arc<S>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2555":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"`ctx.provide_as(key, value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2556":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"以显式键提供任意 `Send + Sync` 值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2557":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"`ctx.provide_arc_as(key, arc)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2558":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"同上，传入 `Arc`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2559":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"`ctx.provide_checked(key, arc, check)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2560":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"一个值，其可用性还取决于谓词 `check`；谓词按每个消费者求值，参数是该消费者的拦截元数据。谓词在运行时锁内执行，不得调用运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2561":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"`ctx.provide_serialized_as(key, value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2562":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"一个 `Serialize` 值，同时带有 **JSON 视图**，可由 `ctx.view(key)`、加载器表达式和访客插件读取。以键提供的 `serde_json::Value`（`provide_as`、`provide_arc_as`、`provide_checked`）本身就是自己的 JSON 视图。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2563":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"提供服务时发生的事：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2564":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"**每个键在每个领域（realm）中只有一个绑定。** 同一领域中的第二个提供者（provider）会失败，错误为 `KardiaError::AlreadyProvided`，消息是 `service \"database\" has been registered at <db>`（尖括号内是提供它的插件名）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2565":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"**通知时机取决于提供者的状态。** 只有提供者纤程处于 `Active` 时才立即通知消费者（consumer）；否则在它进入 `Active` 时通知。提供者离开 `Active` 时，会先通知消费者，再运行它的任何逆操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2566":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"**撤回会等待消费者。** 撤销提供会移除绑定并通知该领域，然后等待所有已提交到这个绑定的消费者完成各自的清理，最后才移除这项提供。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2567":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"**退役的提供者立即让出领域。** 释放（dispose）一个提供者会立即解除它的现存绑定，所以继任者可以在旧消费者仍在清理时于同一领域提供服务（旧消费者通过各自的已提交视图（committed view）继续读取旧绑定）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2568":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"**过期的加载不能提供服务。** 已退役但加载仍在进行的纤程仍可登记逆操作（这样它获取的东西不会泄漏），但其 `provide` 调用会以 `KardiaError::InactiveEffect` 失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2569":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"**清理期间推迟移除。** 提供者卸载期间，它撤回的提供在清理结束前仍对其后代可见，这样后代在自己的清理中仍能使用继承来的服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2570":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"`PluginDef` 上的 `.provides([..])`（或 `#[plugin]` 中的 `provide = [..]`，或 `Plugin::provide()`）只是**声明**插件提供什么。这个声明是供工具和依赖环检查使用的元数据；插件可以提供未声明的键，这些键只是不参与检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2571":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#providing","content":"已绑定的值不能原地覆盖。要改变消费者看到的值，请提供一个新值（撤回后重新提供，或重启、更新提供者），这样变化才会被观察到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2572":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"插件在**依赖声明**（inject）中列出它需要的服务，即一个 `Inject`：有序的键，每个键可带可选的拦截元数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2573":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"声明写在哪里：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2574":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"插件形式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2575":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"声明","locale":"zh-CN"},"2576":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"`impl Plugin for P`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2577":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"`fn inject() -> Inject`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2578":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"`#[plugin]` 函数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2579":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"其上下文参数的类型 `Injected<(A, B)>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2580":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"`PluginDef::new` / `PluginDef::typed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2581":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"`.inject(..)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2582":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"闭包插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2583":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"`ctx.inject(deps, \\|ctx\\| async move { … })`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2584":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"加载器条目","locale":"zh-CN"},"2585":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"条目的 `inject` 字段（见配置）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2586":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"运行时让纤程始终与声明保持一致：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2587":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"在每个声明的服务都可用之前，纤程停留在 `Pending`，之后开始加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2588":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"声明的服务被另一个绑定替换时，纤程卸载并针对新绑定重新加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2589":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"声明的服务消失时，纤程卸载并在 `Pending` 中等待。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2590":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#declaring","content":"**依赖环。** 插入纤程时，运行时检查其所在领域中各现存纤程声明的 `provide` 与 `inject` 集合是否经由它构成环。若构成环，运行时会记录一条指明该环的警告（`dependency cycle: a -> b -> a`），纤程停留在 `Pending`，而不是无声地等待。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2591":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2592":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"2593":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"访问方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2594":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`ctx.get::<S>()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2595":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`Result<Svc<S>, AccessError>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2596":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"受检访问，经已提交视图","locale":"zh-CN"},"2597":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`ctx.get_as::<T>(key)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2598":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`Result<Svc<T>, AccessError>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2599":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"受检访问，按键，适用任意类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2600":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`ctx.view(key)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2601":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`Result<Value, AccessError>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2602":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"受检访问，取服务的 JSON 视图","locale":"zh-CN"},"2603":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`ctx.deps::<(A, B)>()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2604":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`Result<(Svc<A>, Svc<B>), AccessError>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2605":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"受检访问，至多八个服务组成的元组","locale":"zh-CN"},"2606":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`ctx.live::<S>()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2607":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`Option<Svc<S>>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2608":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"反射式访问：本领域的现存绑定（其提供者须处于活动状态）；对未声明的键也不会失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2609":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`ctx.live_as::<T>(key)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2610":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`Option<Svc<T>>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2611":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"同上，按键","locale":"zh-CN"},"2612":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"**受检访问**（论文的算法 6）按如下方式解析一个键：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2613":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"途经的某个纤程自己在同一领域中提供的绑定，直接返回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2614":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"否则沿派生出该上下文的纤程向上查找。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2615":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"遇到再次隔离该键的上下文（隔离边界）时停止：该键视为未声明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2616":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"第一个声明了该键的纤程决定结果：返回该纤程加载时**提交**的绑定；声明了该键却没有已提交绑定的纤程得到 `Inactive`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2617":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"根上下文无法声明 `inject`，它对现存存储有**不受检**的访问权，与 Cordis 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2618":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"受检访问读取的是已提交视图而不是现存存储，所以即使提供者已从存储中消失，消费者在自己拆除期间仍能读取依赖（论文定理 70）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2619":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"错误：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2620":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`AccessError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2621":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"消息","locale":"zh-CN"},"2622":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`Undeclared { key }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2623":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`cannot get property \"key\" without inject`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2624":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`Inactive { key }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2625":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`cannot get required service \"key\" in inactive context`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2626":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`TypeMismatch { key, expected }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2627":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`service \"key\" is not of type …`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2628":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#injected","content":"`Injected<D>` 包装一个插件上下文，其类型化访问在编译期按声明的依赖 `D` 检查。`#[plugin]` 宏从函数签名读出 `D`，同时生成依赖声明和包装：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2629":{"id":"/docs/gui