de-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"代表调用者工作时用的日志器：名称取调用者 `logger` 拦截元数据中的 `name`，否则取提供它的插件名","locale":"zh-CN"},"2650":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`svc.intercepts()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2651":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"本次访问适用的拦截元数据，由外到内","locale":"zh-CN"},"2652":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`svc.meta()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2653":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"用 `S::merge_intercept` 合并后的元数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"2654":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"**代表调用者创建效应。** 为调用者创建效应的服务方法把效应登记在 `svc.caller()` 上。这样效应属于调用者的纤程，在*调用者*卸载时撤销，这正是 Cordis 的追踪器借助 `this.ctx` 达到的效果。服务 crate 把这类方法实现为 **`Svc<S>` 上的扩展 trait**；由于 trait 是本地定义的，一致性规则允许这样做。计时器服务就是这样做的（已简化：实际的 `timeout` 在触发后还会撤销自己的效应）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2655":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"因此上面 `greeter` 中的 `timer.interval(..)` 在 `greeter` 卸载时停止，而不是在计时器插件卸载时停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2656":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"**服务自身的依赖。** 服务通过构造时保存的 `Context`（它的定义点）解析自己的依赖，因此不需要影子上下文。由此产生两点与 Cordis 不同的行为（在 Cordis 中两者都跟随使用点）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2657":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"外层调用者的拦截元数据不会传到该服务继而调用的其他服务；它留在 `Svc::caller()` 上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2658":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"服务通过其保存的上下文创建的效应属于服务自己的纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2659":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#interception","content":"拦截沿上下文链为某个键附加元数据，使服务可以针对不同调用者表现不同（论文定义 26–27）。典型例子是日志器：`logger: { name: db, level: 3 }` 会为其下的一切重命名日志器并调整级别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2660":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#interception","content":"元数据的来源，由外到内：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2661":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#interception","content":"准许本次访问的 `inject` 所声明的元数据（`Inject::with_meta`，或条目的 `inject: { key: meta }`）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2662":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#interception","content":"调用者派生链上的每个 `ctx.intercept(key, meta)`，由外到内（加载器条目的 `intercept` 字段会加上一层）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2663":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#interception","content":"`Svc::intercepts()` 返回这个列表，`Svc::meta()` 用 `S::merge_intercept` 合并它；默认是 `merge_shallow`：逐键合并对象，后者覆盖前者，类似 `Object.assign`。在你的 `Service` 实现中覆盖 `merge_intercept` 即可换用其他合并方式。在上下文上，`ctx.intercepts(key)` 返回链上的元数据，`ctx.intercept_meta::<T>(key)` 合并并反序列化它（元数据格式错误时得到 `T::default()`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2664":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#interception","content":"元数据也会传给可用性谓词：`provide_checked` 把消费者的元数据交给谓词。加载器借此实现 `inject: { loader: { await: true } }`：只有当所有条目都已稳定，`loader` 才对该条目可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2665":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"每个键都位于某个**领域**（realm）中。默认情况下所有上下文共享该键的根领域；隔离一个键会给某个上下文及其派生的一切一个自己的领域：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2666":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2667":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"派生出的上下文中","locale":"zh-CN"},"2668":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"`ctx.isolate(key)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2669":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"`key` 位于一个新的私有领域","locale":"zh-CN"},"2670":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"`ctx.isolate_in(key, realm)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2671":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"`key` 位于给定领域（`RealmId::new()`），所有隔离到该领域的上下文共享它","locale":"zh-CN"},"2672":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"`ctx.extend()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2673":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"上下文拥有自己的可变隔离表和拦截表（一个 `Overlay`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2674":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"`ctx.extend_with(&overlay)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2675":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#isolation","content":"上下文由一个已有的 `Overlay` 支撑，与其他上下文共享","locale":"zh-CN"},"2676":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-152"