":"/docs/guide-services#exporters","content":"`Exporter` 接收每条消息：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2779":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-255","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#exporters","content":"`ctx.add_exporter(Arc::new(exporter))` 把它登记为当前纤程的一个效应。消息的级别不高于 `exporter.level(name)`（没有则取日志器的级别，再没有则取 `Info`）时，才会送达该导出器。`Message` 包含 `sn`（序号，同一次调用送达的所有导出器共享）、`ts`（自 Unix 纪元起的毫秒数）、`name`、`level`、`text`，以及记录它的 `fiber`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2780":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-256","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#exporters","content":"根上下文用一个环形缓冲区保存最近的、级别不高于日志器级别的消息（默认 1000 条）：`ctx.log_buffer()` 按从旧到新返回它们，`ctx.set_log_buffer_size(n)` 调整容量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2781":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-257","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#exporters","content":"终端导出器在 `kardia-logger-console` 中：可以直接登记 `ConsoleExporter::new(ConsoleConfig { .. })`，也可以在配置文件中加载 `logger-console` 插件（其选项列在配置中）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2782":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-258","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#exporters","content":"目前没有 `tracing` 桥接；计划把\"向导出器输送消息的 `tracing_subscriber::Layer`\"作为 `kardia-logger-console` 的可选扩展。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2783":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-259","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#example","content":"一个更长、可运行的版本还会热替换数据库实现：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2784":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"page","content":"TypeScript 与 Tauri","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","使用指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript","locale":"zh-CN"},"2785":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"@kardiajs npm 包：在 TypeScript 中使用同一套插件模型、把 TypeScript 运行时（如 Tauri webview）连接到 Rust kardia 应用的桥，以及 Vue 界面的扩展点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2786":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#model","content":"两个运行时，一套模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2787":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"TypeScript 运行时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2788":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#bridge","content":"桥","locale":"zh-CN"},"2789":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#host","content":"宿主：`kardia-bridge`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2790":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client","content":"客户端：`@kardiajs/bridge` 与 `@kardiajs/tauri`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2791":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client-services","content":"来自客户端的服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2792":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"Vue 界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"2793":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"职责归属","locale":"zh-CN"},"2794":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-typescript#protocol","content":"协议","locale":"zh-CN"},"2795":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"kardia 组合的是 Rust 应用。当应用的一部分是 TypeScript 时（例如界面运行在 webview 中的 Tauri 应用），`@kardiajs` 系列包为这一侧提供同样的模型：插件、服务、可撤销效应与生命周期。两个运行时之间由**桥**（bridge）连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2796":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"包","locale":"zh-CN"},"2797":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2798":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`@kardiajs/core`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2799":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"上下文、纤程、可撤销效应、响应式服务、事件与日志。无依赖，可在浏览器和 Node 中运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2800":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`@kardiajs/timer`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2801":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`timeout`、`interval`、`sleep`、`throttle` 与 `debounce`，在所属插件停止时取消","locale":"zh-CN"},"2802":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`@kardiajs/bridge`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2803":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"桥的客户端","locale":"zh-CN"},"2804":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`@kardiajs/tauri`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2805":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"桥在 Tauri 上的传输：一个命令加一个 `Channel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2806":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`@kardiajs/vue`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2807":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"Vue 集成：贡献点、`<ExtensionSlot>`、组合式函数、路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"2808":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"`kardia-bridge`（crate）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2809":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript","content":"桥的宿主端，位于 Rust 应用中","locale":"zh-CN"},"2810":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#model","content":"每个运行时组合自己的插件。Rust 插件不能是 TypeScript 插件的子插件，反之亦然：效应的逆操作是某个运行时内存中的闭包，服务也是那里的值。因此桥并不共享一棵插件树，而是让每一侧对另一侧的视图保持同步：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2811":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#model","content":"**效应从不跨越边界。** 每一侧各自撤销自己的效应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2812":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#model","content":"**服务的可用性会跨越边界。** 宿主暴露的服务恰在暴露期间出现在客户端，所以注入它的客户端插件恰在此时运行，并在它被重新暴露时重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2813":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#model","content":"**调用是异步的**，两个方向都是。另一侧已不在时调用以 `unavailable` 失败，未按时应答时以 `timeout` 失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2814":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#model","content":"**事件**从宿主发往每个客户端，以名称区分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2815":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#model","content":"这正是论文为跨越进程边界所描述的安排（每个进程承载自己的上下文，进程之间的调用遵循异步约定，见相关工作）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2816":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"它移植的是 Kardia 的核心，而不是对 TypeScript Cordis 的封装：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2817":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"**插件**是函数、类或带 `apply` 的对象，各自可带 `name`、`inject`、`provide` 和 `Config`（任意 Standard Schema 校验器）。`apply` 可以返回 promise，或返回一个在插件停止时运行的函数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2818":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"**服务**以字符串为键。`ctx.get(key)` 是带检查的访问：插件未声明的服务会失败。`ctx.live(key)` 不经检查读取实时存储。`Service` 返回的是一个视图，其 `caller` 是发起访问的上下文，对应 Kardia 的 `Svc::caller`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2819":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"**效应：** `ctx.effect(scope => ...)` 用 `scope.defer` 收集逆操作，或直接返回一个。异步的效应体不会被取消：效应被处置后，`scope.checkpoint()` 会结束它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2820":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"**生命周期：** 纤程依次经历 `pending`、`loading`、`active`、`unloading`、`failed` 和 `disposed`，与 Rust 一致。依赖被替换时插件重启，依赖离开时插件等待，提供者会一直运行到它的消费者完成清理。`fiber.update(config)`、`restart()`、`ctx.onUpdate(...)` 和 `ctx.registry.replace(old, new)`（热替换，用于 Vite HMR）的行为都与 Rust 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2821":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"**事件**以名称区分：`ctx.on`、`emit`、`bail`、`serial`、`parallel`。运行时会报告 `internal/plugin-inserted`、`internal/plugin-removed`、`internal/status`、`internal/service`、`internal/commit` 和 `internal/replace`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2822":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"**隔离与拦截：** `ctx.isolate(key, realm?)`、`ctx.intercept(key, meta)`、`ctx.interceptMeta(key)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2823":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#core","content":"它与 Kardia 和 Cordis 的不同之处列在实现状态中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2824":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#host","content":"应用创建一个 `Bridge`，挂载它的插件，并把客户端请求交给 `Bridge::handle`。插件注入 `bridge` 并暴露服务；暴露是暴露它的插件的效应，因此该插件停止时会被撤回：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2825":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#host","content":"`Bridge::handle` 在桥插件所在的运行时上执行工作，因此 Tauri 命令可以从 Tauri 的运行时调用它。Tauri 一侧的胶水代码只有一个命令（`kardia-bridge` 的 crate 文档给出了完整写法）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2826":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#host","content":"窗口销毁时调用 `bridge.close_client(label)`。页面重新加载无需处理：新会话会替换同一标签的旧会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2827":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client","content":"宿主服务显示为 `host.<name>`，宿主事件显示为 `host/<name>`（`prefix` 选项可以修改 `host`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2828":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client","content":"客户端在后台连接，并在宿主的桥重启后重新连接。断开期间它的插件仍处于活跃状态，只是宿主服务不存在。`bridge.status` 和 `bridge/status` 事件报告 `connecting`、`connected`、`disconnected` 或 `replaced`（同一标签的另一个 webview 接管了会话；此时不会重连）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2829":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client","content":"失败的调用以 `BridgeError` 拒绝，其 `type` 为 `unavailable`、`timeout`、`invalid` 或 `failed`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2830":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client-services","content":"客户端可以向宿主提供服务，作为调用它的插件的效应：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2831":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client-services","content":"宿主把它看作 `RemoteService`，由客户端的会话纤程提供，会话结束时撤回：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2832":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#client-services","content":"客户端随时可能关闭，而 Rust 应用通常在没有任何窗口时也在运行。所以宿主插件应在需要时查找客户端服务（`live_as`），而不是在 `inject` 中声明它，否则窗口一关闭该插件就会停止。每次重连后，客户端都会重新提供它的服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2833":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"`@kardiajs/vue` 让扩展向 Vue 界面贡献内容：组件、视图、设置分区、命令、路由。贡献是做出它的插件的效应，因此该插件停止时贡献随之移除，界面也随之更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2834":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"**贡献点**是 `Contributions<T>` 服务（`defineContributions(key)` 提供一个）。`register(item)` 是调用它的插件的效应；条目按 `order` 排序，`id` 唯一，`items` / `entries` 是 Vue 响应式的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2835":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"**`<ExtensionSlot name>`** 按顺序渲染一个贡献点的组件。每个组件都获得贡献它的插件的上下文，因此在组件内部 `useContext()`、`usePlugin()` 和 `useService()` 都以该插件的身份工作，其效应也随该插件停止。`props` 传给每个组件，位于各贡献自身的 `props` 之下；没有内容时显示默认插槽；`item` 插槽（`{ item, owner }`）可自行渲染每个贡献。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2836":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"**出错的贡献**会被隔离：抛出异常的贡献（在 setup、渲染、钩子、侦听器或事件处理函数中）会被 `error` 插槽（`{ error, item, owner, retry }`）取代，没有该插槽时不渲染任何内容；其他贡献照常渲染，错误也不会传到应用。`retry()` 重新挂载它。`@error`（`{ error, item, owner }`）报告这次失败，例如用于显示是哪个插件出错；没有它时，失败由所属插件的日志器记录。所属插件继续运行：出错的视图只是该插件的一个贡献，停止插件还会移除它的服务和其他贡献。要停止它，可在 `@error` 中调用 `owner.fiber.dispose()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2837":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"**组合式函数：** `useContext()`；`usePlugin(plugin, config)` 在组件存续期间运行一个插件；`useService(key)` 是跟随某个服务的 ref（未被提供时为 `undefined`）；`useContributions(key)` 是用于自定义渲染（如导航菜单）的计算列表；`useFiberState(fiber)` 跟随一个纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2838":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"**路由：** `addRoute(ctx, router, route)` 以效应的形式添加 vue-router 路由：插件停止时路由被移除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2839":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"**只有 Rust 部分的扩展**无法携带 Vue 代码，但 Rust 插件可以暴露一个描述其界面的值（例如设置 schema），再由 TypeScript 插件为它注册一个通用组件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2840":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#vue","content":"第三方界面代码在 webview 中拥有对 Tauri 的全部访问权限：只把可信代码加载到主 webview，对不可信的扩展使用声明式贡献或沙箱化的 webview。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2841":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"归属","locale":"zh-CN"},"2842":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"后端能力、状态、设置、持久化","locale":"zh-CN"},"2843":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"kardia 上的 Rust 插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2844":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"界面组合：设置分区、命令、渲染器、面板","locale":"zh-CN"},"2845":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"`@kardiajs/core` 上的 TypeScript 插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2846":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"客户端能看到哪些宿主服务，以及对它们的调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2847":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"宿主的 `expose`，经由桥","locale":"zh-CN"},"2848":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"传输、窗口身份、权限","locale":"zh-CN"},"2849":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"Tauri（一个命令，每个会话一个 `Channel`，capabilities）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2850":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#responsibilities","content":"一个扩展可以只有 Rust 部分（大多数后端能力；界面渲染它暴露的内容），只有 TypeScript 部分（使用已有宿主服务的面板或命令），或者两者兼有：一个暴露服务的 Rust 插件，加上一个注入 `host.<name>` 的 TypeScript 插件，使界面部分恰在后端部分运行时运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2851":{"id":"/docs/guide-typescript-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-typescript#protocol","content":"协议（版本 1）是以 `type` 标记、字段为 camelCase 的 JSON；未知字段会被忽略。`kardia-bridge` 的 crate 文档列出了每种请求和消息。任何传输都可以使用：桥的端到端测试通过 stdin 和 stdout 驱动 Rust 宿主（`crates/kardia-bridge/examples/stdio_host.rs`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2852":{"id":"/docs/guide","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"page","content":"使用指南","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","使用指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide","locale":"zh-CN"},"2853":{"id":"/docs/guide-0","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"如何使用 kardia：配置文件、插件、服务、效应、加载器、热重载与访客插件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2854":{"id":"/docs/guide-1","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide#which-page-do-i-need","content":"我需要哪一页？","locale":"zh-CN"},"2855":{"id":"/docs/guide-2","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"本指南讲解如何用 kardia 构建应用：从 `kardia` 可执行文件的配置文件，到用 Rust 编写的插件（plugin），再到可以原地重新加载的访客插件（guest plugin）。阅读前请先安装 kardia；快速开始先展示了一个运行中的应用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2856":{"id":"/docs/guide-3","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"<Card title=\"配置文件\" href=\"/docs/guide-configuration\" description=\"条目及其字段、表达式、双向同步与内置插件。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2857":{"id":"/docs/guide-4","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"<Card title=\"编写插件\" href=\"/docs/guide-plugins\" description=\"用 Rust 编写服务和插件：#[derive(Service)]、#[plugin]、PluginDef，以及为加载器注册插件。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2858":{"id":"/docs/guide-5","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"<Card title=\"服务\" href=\"/docs/guide-services\" description=\"提供和使用服务、调用者归属、拦截、事件与日志。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2859":{"id":"/docs/guide-6","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"<Card title=\"效应\" href=\"/docs/guide-effects\" description=\"可撤销效应、撤销函数、效应作用域，以及插件如何被拆除。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2860":{"id":"/docs/guide-7","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"<Card title=\"加载器\" href=\"/docs/guide-loader\" description=\"在 Rust 中驱动条目、分组、隔离、include 与目录。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2861":{"id":"/docs/guide-8","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"<Card title=\"热重载\" href=\"/docs/guide-hot-reload\" description=\"原地重新加载访客模块，以及监视模式。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2862":{"id":"/docs/guide-9","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"<Card title=\"访客插件\" href=\"/docs/guide-guests\" description=\"WebAssembly、动态库与进程访客，以及访客接口。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2863":{"id":"/docs/guide-10","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"<Card title=\"TypeScript 与 Tauri\" href=\"/docs/guide-typescript