page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#logger-console","content":"浏览器构建委托给 `console.*`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3048":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-29","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#fs-node","content":"`index.ts`、`watcher.ts`。服务 `fs`，目前只有 `watch(path, { filter }) → Watcher`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3049":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-30","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#fs-node","content":"路径相对于**调用方的** `ctx.baseUrl` 解析；接受 `file:` URL；拒绝 Windows 的驱动器相对路径形式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3050":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-31","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#fs-node","content":"单个文件**通过其父目录**监听（`depth: 0`），因此基于重命名的原子写入不会丢失监听。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3051":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-32","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#fs-node","content":"`Watcher` 是一个包装 chokidar（`ignoreInitial`）的异步效应，在初始扫描之后注册。只转发 `change` 事件；`ready` 会异步地向后加入的监听器重放；分发使用快照；监听器错误交给 `error` 监听器（其自身的错误只被记录）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3052":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-33","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#fs-node","content":"过滤器由类 gitignore 的规则组成：**最后一个匹配胜出**，对条目*或其任一祖先*进行测试。若后面某条包含规则的字面基础路径与某目录相关，该目录仍会被遍历；离开根目录的模式会被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3053":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-34","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"`index.ts`、`agent.ts`、`manifest.ts`、`backup.ts`、`process.ts`、`state.ts`。服务 `packageManager`：驱动 npm / pnpm / yarn classic / yarn berry 的事务式依赖安装（仅限提升式 `node_modules`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3054":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-35","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"`install(changes, { signal })` 串行执行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3055":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-36","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"从 `package.json#packageManager` 检测代理（精确版本，经 `--version` 验证），要求存在锁文件，并检查目录布局。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3056":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-37","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"对安装状态做快照，并备份清单、锁文件与 rc 文件（保留权限模式与符号链接）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3057":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-38","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"编辑 `package.json`（保留缩进、行尾与排序）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3058":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-39","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"以**无活动超时**和中止支持运行代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3059":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-40","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"对比安装状态（`added/removed/updated`，附真实路径）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3060":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-41","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"失败时：恢复文件并运行一次**不可取消的恢复安装**；若这也失败，则抛出 `AggregateError`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3061":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-42","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"进程在自己的进程组中启动（POSIX），并杀死整个进程树（SIGTERM → SIGKILL；Windows 上为 `taskkill /T`）。环境中会清除外层 `yarn run` 泄漏的变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3062":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-43","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"真实路径使用 Node 的 JS `realpath` 算法，以便与模块 URL 匹配（本意是为 hmr 提供根；仓库中尚未接通）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3063":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-44","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#loader-utils","content":"`index.ts`、`internal.ts`。`unwrapExports`（ESM/esbuild 互操作）以及 `ModuleLoader.fromInternal()`，后者提供对 Node 内部级联 ESM 加载器的访问（在 Node 22–24.12+ 之间按 API 是否存在来检测其形态）。纯粹的 Node 胶水代码；**没有 Rust 对应物**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3064":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-45","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#create","content":"`create/src/index.ts`、`bin.ts`。一个独立的脚手架 CLI（不使用 core）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3065":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-46","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#create","content":"提示输入名称并准备目录；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3066":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-47","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#create","content":"从配置的 npm 注册表获取模板包（`@cordisjs/boilerplate`）的 tarball，并以 `strip: 1` 解压；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3067":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-48","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#create","content":"可选地放置一个固定版本的 Yarn 二进制（五条成文规则）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3068":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-49","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#create","content":"改写 `package.json`，可选地 `git init`，安装并启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3069":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-50","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#create","content":"错误时打印固定消息并 `process.exit(1)`（测试以子进程方式运行它）。`--mirror` 标志会被解析但未被使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3070":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-51","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#port","content":"timer、fs 与日志导出器都是薄包装，证明了 **“由效应决定生存期” + 调用方归属** 足以让任意资源变得可撤销：这正是论文 §6.1 中“在边界内获取资源”的模式（见讨论与相关工作）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3071":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-52","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#port","content":"package-manager 与 create 是 Node 生态的工具；对 Rust 框架而言，它们是可选的，或必须重新定位目标（例如 Cargo / WASM 组件包）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3072":{"id":"/docs/reference-context","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"page","content":"上下文与反射","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","Cordis 参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context","locale":"zh-CN"},"3073":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-0","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context","content":"Cordis 核心如何表示上下文、按领域存储服务绑定、通知依赖方，并通过 Proxy 解析余效应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3074":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-1","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#context","content":"`Context`：一等上下文","locale":"zh-CN"},"3075":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-2","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"构造","locale":"zh-CN"},"3076":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-3","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"用 `extend()` 派生","locale":"zh-CN"},"3077":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-4","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#realm-symbols","content":"领域符号","locale":"zh-CN"},"3078":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-5","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"`ReflectService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3079":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-6","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#impl","content":"`Impl`：一个绑定","locale":"zh-CN"},"3080":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-7","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"`provide(name, value?, check?)`：余效应的提供","locale":"zh-CN"},"3081":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-8","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#set","content":"`set(name, value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3082":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-9","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#get","content":"`get(name, strict = true)` 与 `_getImpl`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3083":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-10","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#notify","content":"`notify(names, filter?)`：响应式通知","locale":"zh-CN"},"3084":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-11","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`accessor` 与 `mixin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3085":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-12","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"经由 Proxy 的属性访问","locale":"zh-CN"},"3086":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-13","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#locate","content":"`locate(ctx, name)`：已提交视图的遍历","locale":"zh-CN"},"3087":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-14","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#interception","content":"拦截","locale":"zh-CN"},"3088":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-15","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#design-observations","content":"设计观察","locale":"zh-CN"},"3089":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-16","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context","content":"本页介绍 `cordis/packages/core/src/context.ts`、`reflect.ts` 与 `utils.ts`。对应的论文内容是 §3.2（余效应（coeffect），见响应式余效应）、§5.1.2（算法 2–3）与 §5.1.4（算法 6），后两者见实现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3090":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-17","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#context","content":"`context.ts` 声明：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3091":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-18","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"`new Context()` 构建**根**上下文（`context.ts:36-49`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3092":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-19","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"创建空的 `isolate`/`intercept` 表（`Object.create(null)`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3093":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-20","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"用 `ReflectService.handler` 把自身包装进一个 `Proxy`。这个代理*就是*所有人看到的上下文；`this[symbols.root] = self`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3094":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-21","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"创建**根纤程（fiber）** `new Fiber(self, {}, {}, null, …)`（runtime 为 `null` ⇒ 根，uid 0，`ACTIVE`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3095":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-22","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"在根上实例化四个内置服务（service）：`reflect`、`registry`、`events`、`logger`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3096":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-23","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"调用 `this.fiber._disposables.clear()`。构造期间注册的内置 mixin 与访问器*不*属于根纤程的可撤销效应（revertible effect）：它们必须在 `root.fiber.dispose()` 之后依然存在。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3097":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-24","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"`context.ts:55-63`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3098":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-25","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"每个派生上下文都是其父上下文的**原型链子对象**。这实现了论文中的*派生实现*（derived realization，定义 23）：子对象覆盖部分槽位，其余全部继承。无需撤销任何东西：丢弃子对象即丢弃了这次调整。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3099":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-26","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"`isolate(name, label?)`（`context.ts:65`）创建 `Object.create(this[symbols.isolate])`，设置 `shadow[name] = label ?? Symbol(name)` 并以此扩展。新符号给出私有领域（realm）；共享的 `label` 给出共享领域。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3100":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-27","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"`intercept(name, config)`（`context.ts:73`）以相同模式处理拦截（interception）表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3101":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-28","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"纤程的上下文是 `parent.extend({ fiber: this })`（`fiber.ts:150`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3102":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-29","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"**关键性质：** 隔离（isolation）表与拦截表都是*原型链*。查找（`table[name]`）看到最近的覆盖；`Object.hasOwn(table, name)` 检测恰好在这一层引入的隔离边界（`locate` 使用了这一点）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3103":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-30","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#realm-symbols","content":"`ReflectService.provide` 惰性地分配根领域：`ctx[symbols.root][symbols.isolate][name] ??= Symbol(name)`（`reflect.ts:222`）。因此，一旦被提供，*每个*服务名在根表中都有一个领域符号；被隔离的上下文会覆盖它。**存储以领域符号为键**，从而得到定义 24 的两层解析 `k → ρ(k) → σ(ρ(k))`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3104":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-31","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"`reflect.ts` 持有共享的根级表：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3105":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-32","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3106":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-33","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tag