件变化时重新加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3511":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-21","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#integration","content":"`watch.files`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3512":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-22","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#integration","content":"`['.', '!**/node_modules', '!**/.*']`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3513":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-23","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#integration","content":"glob 过滤器","locale":"zh-CN"},"3514":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-24","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#integration","content":"`watch.debounce`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3515":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-25","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#integration","content":"100 ms","locale":"zh-CN"},"3516":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-26","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#integration","content":"重新加载前的防抖时间","locale":"zh-CN"},"3517":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-27","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#integration","content":"它需要 Node 的内部 ESM 加载器（`loader-utils` → `ModuleLoader.fromInternal()`，需要 `--expose-internals` 或 `node-addon-require-builtin` 原生扩展）；否则构造函数抛出异常（纤程（fiber）FAILED，没有服务）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3518":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-28","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#integration","content":"监听是一个可选的嵌套插件 `ctx.inject(['fs'], ...)`，只在存在 `fs` 服务时活跃。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3519":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-29","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#integration","content":"`[Service.init]` 记录**宿主（host）模块**：`process.argv[1]` 的导入闭包（主程序、core、loader……），它们只能通过重启进程来改变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3520":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-30","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#integration","content":"没有任何加载器特有的代码：加载器通过同一个内部 ESM 加载器导入插件，因此它们的模块就在 hmr 检查的缓存中。hmr 在**注册表**（registry）层面替换插件，加载器的条目（entry）保留其纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3521":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-31","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#module-graph","content":"hmr **不维护自己的图**。它每次都从 Node 的 ESM `loadCache`（`ModuleJob.linked`）与 CJS 的 `require.cache` 读取实时的图（`_edges`、`closure`）。内置模块（`node:`）被跳过；原生扩展（native addon，`.node`）无法被重新加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3522":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-32","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"`index.ts:309-699`。事务在一个 promise 队列上串行执行；从事务内部发起的重入调用（来自回调，或来自第 3 阶段中某个插件的 `apply`）会借助 `AsyncLocalStorage` 被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3523":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-33","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"**根（Roots）**：`await callback()` → 绝对路径（经校验）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3524":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-34","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"**清扫（Sweep）**：按类型槽位，从缓存中逐出*失败的* ModuleJob（Node 会保留它们，并在每次导入时重新抛出）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3525":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-35","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"**匹配（Match）**：路径以某个根为祖先的已加载模块（按完整路径段匹配）。宿主模块与原生扩展 → `skippedHostModules`（仅报告）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3526":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-36","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"**分析（Analyze）**：反向边（不含来自宿主模块的边）。`accepted` = 变化的模块加上所有传递地导入它们的模块；`declined` = 宿主 ∪ 其余。*（论文的算法 8 是在正向导入上求不动点，环默认为 declined；代码则是更简单的反向可达工作表。）*","locale":"zh-CN"},"3527":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-37","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"**发现（Discover）**：对 accepted 模块解包其导出，保留其中已注册的插件；**按 runtime 分组**（多个模块可以导出同一个插件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3528":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-38","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"**过时插件（Stale plugins）**：对每个 runtime，取其导出者经由 accepted 模块的闭包。要重新导入的模块是**最外层的导出者**（保留入口模块的 `inject`/`Config` 元数据）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3529":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-39","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"**备份并逐出**每个要逐出的 URL（整个多槽位 ESM 条目 + CJS 模块）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3530":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-40","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"**第 1 阶段，导入**，对每个过时插件依次执行：重新导入，并检查其导出是一个有效插件（`registry.resolve`）。*所有可能失败的校验都发生在这里，此时只有模块缓存被修改过*，因此后续阶段无需回滚。在所有插件都导入完成之前，不恢复任何缓存条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3531":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-41","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"**用并查集划分单元**：若两次尝试的**旧 ∪ 新**闭包共享某个被逐出的模块，它们就并入同一个单元（共享同一个变化依赖的两个插件，不能最终持有该依赖的不同实例）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3532":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-42","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"**中止/提交**：存在任何导入失败的单元被中止，其模块被恢复。孤立的被逐出模块随与之重叠的中止单元一起恢复（除非它们能到达某个已提交单元）。与已恢复模块链接的第 1 阶段加载模块会被逐出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3533":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-43","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"**第 2 阶段，替换（同步）**：对每个已提交的尝试执行 `ctx.registry.replace(oldPlugin, newPlugin)`。`replace` 把旧插件键作为新插件的别名（此后 `ctx.plugin(old)` 实例化新代码），并在每个纤程上调用 `fiber._replace(newRuntime, newInject)`：重新检查依赖、清除错误、递增修订号 ⇒ **同一个纤程对象原地卸载并重新加载**（身份、父级、配置与加载器条目均被保留）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3534":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-44","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"**第 3 阶段，稳定（并发）**：`await Promise.all(fibers.map(f => f.await().catch(noop)))`。**没有回滚**：新 `apply` 抛出的插件保持 FAILED（与冷启动时一样），并在下一次变化时重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3535":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-45","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#reconcile","content":"结果为 `{ settledFibers, importFailures: { urls, error }[], skippedHostModules }`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3536":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-46","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#state-preservation","content":"保留","locale":"zh-CN"},"3537":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-47","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#state-preservation","content":"丢失","locale":"zh-CN"},"3538":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-48","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#state-preservation","content":"纤程对象与 uid、父级、配置、加载器条目、*其他*纤程的服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"3539":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-49","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#state-preservation","content":"旧实例的全部效应（由正常的卸载路径释放，它会先等待依赖方，因此新实例永远不会与旧实例重叠），以及被重新导入模块的模块级状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"3540":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-50","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#state-preservation","content":"无关的插件不受影响。不同的纤程并发地重新加载（一个慢的排空不会拖慢一个快的插件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3541":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-51","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#watch","content":"`index.ts:135-186`。`ctx.fs.watch(baseDir, { filter }).on('change', f => …)` → 防抖 → 串行的 `flush`，协调 `retained ∪ stashed`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3542":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-52","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#watch","content":"宿主模块的变化会给出警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3543":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-53","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#watch","content":"失败单元的文件会被**保留**，并与下一次变化一起重试（当一个坏文件与其依赖中只有一个被修复时，二者会一起重试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3544":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-54","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#watch","content":"只有 `change` 事件；新文件只有在某个变化的导入者导入它时才有意义。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3545":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-55","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#error-ts","content":"用 `@babel/code-frame` 美化打印 esbuild 的 `BuildFailure`（tsx 转译错误）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3546":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-56","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#paper-vs-code","content":"方面","locale":"zh-CN"},"3547":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-57","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#paper-vs-code","content":"论文（算法 8–10）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3548":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-58","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#paper-vs-code","content":"代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3549":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-59","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#paper-vs-code","content":"分类","locale":"zh-CN"},"3550":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-60","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#paper-vs-code","content":"正向不动点；环默认为 declined","locale":"zh-CN"},"3551":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-61","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#paper-vs-code","content":"从变化模块出发的反向可达；宿主模块 declined","locale":"zh-CN"},"3552":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-62","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#paper-vs-code","content":"过时检测","locale":"zh-CN"},"3553":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-63","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#paper-vs-code","content":"按*条目*（`entry.url`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3554":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-64","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#paper-vs-code","content":"按*插件 runtime*（任何由 accepted 模块导出的已注册插件）；与加载器无关","locale":"zh-CN"},"3555":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-65","page_id":"/docs/refe