:{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-76","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#paper-vs-code","content":"串行队列 + AsyncLocalStorage 拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"3567":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-77","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#paper-vs-code","content":"代码的设计可以说更强：提交/中止按单元进行，而且“不可回头点”被放在唯一一个可以干净还原的可失败步骤之后。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3568":{"id":"/docs/reference-hmr-78","page_id":"/docs/reference-hmr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-hmr#node-specific","content":"模块图中的全部内容，以及事务的第 2、7–8、10 步，都依赖于 Node 的模块缓存与内部机制。而*算法*本身（匹配 → 接受 → 按 runtime 分组 → 第 1 阶段校验 → 并查集单元 → 原地替换 → 稳定）只要存在一个由宿主拥有的模块注册表即可移植。kardia 的设计见加载器、include 与 HMR。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3569":{"id":"/docs/reference-include","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","type":"page","content":"Include 与分组","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","Cordis 参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-include","locale":"zh-CN"},"3570":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-0","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include","content":"@cordisjs/plugin-include 如何把 YAML/JSON 文件嫁接进条目树并保持文件与纤程的双向同步，以及 @cordisjs/plugin-group 是什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3571":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-1","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-include#group","content":"分组","locale":"zh-CN"},"3572":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-2","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-include#include","content":"Include：以文件支撑的 `EntryTree`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3573":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-3","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-include#state","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"3574":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-4","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-include#io-loop","content":"IO 循环","locale":"zh-CN"},"3575":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-5","page_id":"/docs/refere