include#write","content":"文件变更被整体导出（**整文件重新生成：注释与格式会丢失**）并原子写入：在同一目录下的临时文件 `.<base>.<pid>.<seq>.tmp`，在**每次**重命名尝试前检查内容是否过时，遇到 EACCES/EPERM/EBUSY 时重试重命名（11 次尝试，线性退避）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3622":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-52","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#write","content":"只读文件把变更保留在内存中，并给出警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3623":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-53","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#apply","content":"`applyPatches(cache.data, patches)`（每次都是新克隆，因此移除补丁即可还原）→ `applyJournal(data, journal)`（叠加尚未写入的运行时变更）→ 最新者胜出的 `root.update(tree)` → `EntryGroup` 按键协调。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3624":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-54","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`journal.ts` 由纯函数组成：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3625":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-55","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"函数","locale":"zh-CN"},"3626":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-56","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"3627":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-57","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`record`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3628":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-58","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"在报告时捕获的增量","locale":"zh-CN"},"3629":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-59","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`mergeRecords`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3630":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-60","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"remove∘created-upsert = 无；remove 之后的 upsert ⇒ `created:false`；changes 按较新者胜出合并","locale":"zh-CN"},"3631":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-61","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`flatten`、`applyChanges`、`detach`、`place`、`applyJournal`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3632":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-62","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"把记录应用到条目列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"3633":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-63","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`reconcile(journal, base, theirs, fileOwned)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3634":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-64","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"三方合并，冲突的键/移动/移除会从 journal 中丢弃（“文件胜出”）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3635":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-65","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"`patch.ts`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3636":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-66","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"**插入补丁** `{ id?, insert: [...] }` 把条目追加到某个分组（或根）中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3637":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-67","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"**覆盖补丁** `{ id, name?, ...keys }` 覆盖现有条目的键。若给出 `name`，它必须匹配（防止误给另一个插件打补丁）；覆盖分组的 `config` 会替换其子级列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3638":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-68","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"`applyPatches` 构建一个 `PatchIndex`，记录每个条目与键的**所有者**：`file`、`patch{index}` 或 `embedded{index, key}`。后面的补丁可以引用前面补丁插入的条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3639":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-69","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"`routeJournal` 把每次运行时编辑写回其所有者：补丁拥有的键 → 该补丁；由补丁插入的条目 → 补丁内部；其余 → 文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3640":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-70","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#source-locations","content":"`_route(id, path)` 找到某个值被写在哪里（文件、补丁、嵌入），并沿嵌套的 include 向上委托，生成形如 `at a (inner.yml:1:3)` / `at inc (middle.yml:1:3)` 的虚拟栈帧。`walk` 下降遍历 YAML AST（把别名解析到锚点）；`seekExpr`/`scanScalar` 把表达式内部的偏移映射为文件偏移（解码带引号标量中的转义）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3641":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-71","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"3642":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-72","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"所在","locale":"zh-CN"},"3643":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-73","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"`ConfigFileError(stage: 'read'\\|'parse'\\|'validate', path, cause, issues[])`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3644":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-74","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"include","locale":"zh-CN"},"3645":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-75","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"`StaleWriteError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3646":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-76","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"include（内部）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3647":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-77","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"`EntryValidationError`、`ModuleNotFoundError`、重定位后的 `ValidationError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3648":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-78","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"加载器","locale":"zh-CN"},"3649":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-79","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#design-notes","content":"include 是论文中配置与纤程（fiber）之间*双向*绑定最清晰的例子：运行时变更（插件自我更新或自我禁用、API 编辑）流回文件，文件编辑流入纤程，冲突以确定性的方式解决。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3650":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-80","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#design-notes","content":"正确性依赖于合流性（定理 80，见元理论）：include 可以应用中间树、跳过它们（最新者胜出）或以不同顺序应用；静止状态只取决于最终的树。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3651":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-81","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#design-notes","content":"同步核心（journal、补丁、协调、路由、id 分配）是对条目列表的**纯数据变换**，也是整个代码库中最易移植的部分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3652":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"page","content":"加载器","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","Cordis 参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader","locale":"zh-CN"},"3653":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-0","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader","content":"@cordisjs/plugin-loader 如何把声明式的条目树变为纤程并使两者保持同步：条目、表达式、协调、托管领域与校验。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3654":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-1","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#role","content":"职责","locale":"zh-CN"},"3655":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-2","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#data-model","content":"数据模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3656":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-3","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#entry-options","content":"`EntryOptions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3657":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-4","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#entry","content":"`Entry`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3658":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-5","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#two-fibers","content":"设置 `inject` 时每个条目有两个纤程","locale":"zh-CN"},"3659":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-6","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#hooks","content":"加载器安装的核心钩子","locale":"zh-CN"},"3660":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-7","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#expressions","content":"表达式","locale":"zh-CN"},"3661":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-8","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#algorithms","content":"算法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3662":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-9","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#entry-update","content":"`Entry.update(options, create, force)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3663":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-10","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#init","content":"`init` / `_init`：并发安全的（重新）初始化","locale":"zh-CN"},"3664":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-11","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#entry-tree","content":"`EntryTree` 与 `EntryGroup`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3665":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-12","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#module-import","content":"模块导入（Node 特有）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3666":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-13","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"托管领域","locale":"zh-CN"},"3667":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-14","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#validation","content":"校验","locale":"zh-CN"},"3668":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-15","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-loader#concurrency","content"