9":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-93","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#target","content":"**代码：** `_runner.epoch` = `\"<revision>:<uid>:<uid>…\"` 或 `'__INACTIVE__'`。**修订**计数器把配置修订折叠进目标：`restart()`、`update()` 与 `registry.replace()` 会递增它，从而在不使纤程（fiber）退役的情况下强制一条卸载→重新加载链。这比“退役 → 移除 → 以同一名称重新插入”更廉价地实现了 §4.4 *Configuration* 的修订。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3900":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-94","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#target","content":"见目标计算。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3901":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-95","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#retirement","content":"**论文：** O-Retire（设置 τ）与 O-Remove（删除条目）是两条独立的规则；退役的条目可能残留（vestigial）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3902":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-96","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#retirement","content":"**代码：** 实例化效应的逆操作设置 `uid = null`（立即从 runtime 中移除），把目标强制为 ⊥，然后等待转换链；最终状态为 `DISPOSED`。不存在持久的退役条目注册表。重新启用一个条目会创建一个**全新的纤程**（如论文所规定）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3903":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-97","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#retirement","content":"见实例化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3904":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-98","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#guard","content":"**论文（算法 5）：** `unload` 等待被 `notify(...)` 的依赖方的 `await()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3905":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-99","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#guard","content":"**代码：** 显式的反向引用 `Impl.dependents: Set<Fiber>`，在提交时填充，在依赖方卸载结束时移除，外加唤醒用的 resolver（`impl.release`、`fiber._release`）。存在两层守卫：**纤程级**守卫（在提供者的*所有*提供项都空闲之前，它的任何撤销函数都不运行）与 `provide` 逆操作内部的**绑定级**守卫。这给出了论文按绑定的语义（`relied_n`），同时允许提供者撤回一个绑定而无需等待另一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3906":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-100","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#guard","content":"见两层守卫。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3907":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-101","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#accumulator","content":"**论文：** 累加器是一个 LIFO 组合；算法 5 运行一次 `fiber.dispose()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3908":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-102","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#accumulator","content":"**代码：** 纤程级撤销函数按逆序*发起*，但**并发**运行（`Promise.all`），每个都在一个微任务之后开始；错误被记录，且不会阻止其他撤销函数。顺序 LIFO 只在*单个* `ctx.effect` 内部成立。论文承认了这种并发（§5.1.3），定理 43（独立的逆操作可交换）为其提供了依据，但这意味着对顺序敏感的拆除必须组合进同一个效应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3909":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-103","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#accumulator","content":"见纤程级累加器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3910":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-104","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#iteration-boundaries","content":"**论文：** 每次迭代之前检查守卫；L-Divert 可以中止，也可以落地。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3911":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-105","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#iteration-boundaries","content":"**代码：** 只有**异步**迭代器可中断；同步迭代器与普通函数运行至结束（在单线程宿主中它们本来也无法被中断）。异步迭代器采取*落地*分支（惯性宿主），并以 `iter.return()` 关闭，使 `finally` 块得以运行。`_reload` 在执行前还会让出一个微任务，因此被取代的加载永远不会开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3912":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-106","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#notification","content":"**论文：** `notify` 遍历所有纤程并调用 `refresh`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3913":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-107","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#notification","content":"**代码：** 遍历所有 runtime 的纤程，按声明的键与**领域符号**（或在领域迁移期间按自定义过滤器）筛选，只重新计算受影响的键（`_checkImpl`），然后调用 `_refresh`。它还会发出 `internal/service`。纤程提供项的通知只在进入或离开 `ACTIVE` 的转换上由 `_updateState` 发出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3914":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-108","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#notification","content":"见 `notify`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3915":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-109","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#availability","content":"代码增加了 `Impl.check`（来自 `Service[symbols.check]`）：提供者即使处于 `ACTIVE`，也可以报告自己不可用（`loader` 用它实现 `{ await: true }`）。这为满足谓词 `σ ⊧ d` 扩展了一个按提供者的条件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3916":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-110","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#access","content":"`locate` 另外 (a) 允许纤程不经声明就读取其**自有**提供项，(b) 在**隔离边界**处终止继承。根纤程（没有 runtime）获得*不加检查*的访问（`reflect.get(prop, false)`），因为根代码无法声明 `inject`。见 `locate`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3917":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-111","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#caller-attribution","content":"tracker/影子代理机制（服务与可追溯性）把服务方法内部创建的效应归属到**调用方**纤程，并从服务的**定义点**解析其自身依赖。论文的封闭性（confinement，定义 55）隐含地假设了这一点；没有它，经由服务产生的效应就会属于提供者，从而破坏消费者的时间可组合性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3918":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-112","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#loader-specifics","content":"见加载器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3919":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-113","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#loader-specifics","content":"带 `inject` 的条目有两个纤程（外层依赖持有者 + 内层插件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3920":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-114","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#loader-specifics","content":"表达式（`!!js`）在特定上下文中求值；`disabled` 判定被缓存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3921":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-115","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#loader-specifics","content":"自我释放检测 → 持久化 `disabled: true`；自我更新 → 持久化配置（`internal/commit`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3922":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-116","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#loader-specifics","content":"`loader { await: true }` 屏障。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3923":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-117","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#loader-specifics","content":"领域迁移无需重启提供者；被阻止的迁移通过 `Impl.isolate` 追踪。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3924":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-118","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#hmr","content":"见 HMR：论文与代码对照：注册表层面的原地替换（`registry.replace` + `_replace` + 修订号递增）取代 dispose + `ctx.use`；并查集提交单元取代全有或全无；越过不可回头点之后不再回滚。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3925":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-119","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"假设","locale":"zh-CN"},"3926":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-120","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"代码中的状况","locale":"zh-CN"},"3927":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-121","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"效应见证（逆操作确实能还原）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3928":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-122","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"不检查，是作者的义务（论文已说明）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3929":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-123","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"余效应（coeffect）的可交换性","locale":"zh-CN"},"3930":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-124","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"不检查，是提供者的义务（论文已说明）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3931":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-125","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"≺ 的无环性","locale":"zh-CN"},"3932":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-126","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"**不检测**：依赖环会让纤程静默地停留在 PENDING；论文（§6.5）说运行时*可以*在加载时报告它，但 Cordis 没有这样做","locale":"zh-CN"},"3933":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-127","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"提供的完全性（定义 76）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3934":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-128","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"不强制；插件上的 `provide` 元数据只是声明性的","locale":"zh-CN"},"3935":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-129","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"封闭性（定义 55）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3936":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-130","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#unchecked","content":"只对经由代理的余效应*访问*强制执行；任意 JS 代码仍可触及全局对象","locale":"zh-CN"},"3937":{"id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code-131","page_id":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-paper-vs-code#defects","content":"位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"