ference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services","content":"本页介绍 `cordis/packages/core/src/service.ts` 与 `utils.ts:113-238`。对应的论文内容是 §5.1.4（上下文访问，见实现）与 §6.3（能力，见讨论与相关工作）。这一机制在论文中大多是*隐含*的，但在实践中对时间可组合性（temporal composability）至关重要。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3957":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-7","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"一个服务（service）由一个纤程（fiber，即提供者（provider））提供，被许多其他纤程（消费者（consumer））调用。当消费者调用例如 `ctx.timer.setTimeout(cb, 100)` 时，它创建的定时器是一个效应（effect），必须**归消费者的纤程所有**。否则，卸载消费者会泄漏该定时器，而卸载提供者会杀死它在概念上并不拥有的定时器。同样，`ctx.logger('x')` 应以调用方插件命名。因此，Cordis 在每次服务调用上区分两个上下文：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3958":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-8","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"3959":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-9","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"是什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"3960":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-10","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"决定","locale":"zh-CN"},"3961":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-11","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"**使用点**（use site）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3962":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-12","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"访问服务时所在的上下文（调用方）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3963":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-13","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"*效应*、*拦截*、*隔离*","locale":"zh-CN"},"3964":{"id":"/docs/reference-services-14","page_id":"/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-services#problem","content":"**定义点**（def site）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3965"