:"text","url":"/en/docs/development#decisions","content":"`Send + Sync` core; one state lock per root; **no user code runs while the lock is held**; every JS \"synchronous segment\" becomes one critical section; follow-up work is returned as an action list and executed after unlocking","locale":"en"},"5516":{"id":"/en/docs/development-36","page_id":"/en/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development#decisions","content":"Concurrency","locale":"en"},"5517":{"id":"/en/docs/development-37","page_id":"/en/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development#decisions","content":"D2","locale":"en"},"5518":{"id":"/en/docs/development-38","page_id":"/en/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development#decisions","content":"Fibers live in a registry arena addressed by never-reused `FiberId`s; all cross references (parent, dependents, committed view) are ids, never pointers","locale":"en"},"5519":{"id":"/en/docs/development-39","page_id":"/en/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development#decisions","content":"Core data structures","locale":"en"},"5520":{"id":"/en/docs/development-40","page_id":"/en/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development#decisions","content":"D3","locale":"en"},"5521":{"id":"/en/docs/development-41","page_id":"/en/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development#decisions","content":"Service keys are **strings** (needed by configuration) bound to a **Rust type** via a `Service` trait; values stored as `Arc<dyn Any + Send + Sync>` plus their `TypeId` (detects key collisions)","locale":"en"},"5522":{"id":"/en/docs/development-42","page_id":"/en/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development#decisions","content":"Services","locale":"en"},"5523":{"id":"/en/docs/development-43","page_id":"/en/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development#decisions","content":"D4","locale":"en"},"5524